	 ('6247bb7a-b423-4f68-9660-36cd4d16df49'::uuid,'Victor was a young boy who talked to Mara Jansen when she was in the Central Zoo. He had a younger sister.

Victor was among a group of small children clustered near the bars of the monkey house, where the tributes were located. When Corin Snow walked over and asked the children if they would like to meet Emma James, Victor was eager for the opportunity. He shook hands with Emma James and told her about his sister.','{"source": "Pontius.txt", "charset": "UTF-8", "chunk_id": 0, "position": 0, "chunk_index": 0, "total_chunks": 1, "source_document": "/Users/artem/IdeaProjects/practicum/sprint07/ragbot/./data/replaced/Pontius.txt", "parent_document_id": "a5e9ea5b-2975-47b0-8351-24294e3730a3"}','[0.031210316,0.048483558,-0.0035655543,-0.031673316,-0.011284258,-0.040571734,0.031007301,-0.018578483,0.017811453,0.027633412,-0.04044827,-0.07745522,0.04073576,-0.048940774,-0.06645926,0.011698054,0.024483344,0.046802722,0.04468665,0.06998459,-0.029439375,0.028039271,0.016220953,-0.10135588,0.0132884495,0.01844399,0.022324357,0.01675912,-0.07227981,-0.009432924,0.018033275,0.046779443,0.015620086,0.01986121,-0.0049916664,0.0138497455,-0.02106694,0.0019709785,0.013467304,-0.026856035,0.009563151,0.021139132,0.035539564,-0.020211242,0.03560397,0.00157095,0.03100543,-0.032522794,-0.001620335,-0.024745207,0.0016171922,-0.04444461,-0.0053114207,-0.029622532,-0.0063803704,0.010927284,-0.0063728564,0.013124871,-0.021456843,0.032630943,-0.034299802,-0.027362095,-0.051635228,0.049120408,-0.010388978,-0.034247596,0.0005216544,-0.017382002,0.0053534536,0.028743433,-0.005116833,0.020720724,-0.015683372,-0.015605051,0.015680745,0.050150752,-0.06891463,-0.036157448,0.009647868,0.028793676,-0.0041306578,-0.011142899,-0.010355725,-0.03130216,0.015429471,-0.03396901,-0.01567825,-0.0106701655,0.014675203,-0.025879854,-0.013622984,0.033353146,-0.015794115,0.05337229,0.031672526,-0.020426057,0.016741434,0.026527103,-0.023623494,0.010198884,0.022149215,0.025225384,-0.010959658,0.0066033136,0.029244684,-0.026630122,0.01216787,-0.045202952,-0.028842127,-0.011464439,0.01845168,0.0240937,0.009281036,0.031734