	 ('ce2adf51-9bd9-409f-9f30-f16a0b179358'::uuid,'The other tribute then told him to go to sleep and he passed away.

When interviewed, Lysandra told them that her tribute had contracted rabies in the The Central City, and that he was a good person. Afterwards, Lysandra began collecting her things. Although urged to stay for dinner with the other mentors, she said that she just wanted to go home, saying that the other mentor was a good ally while tearfully wiping her eyes.

Lysandra was thought of as a self-contained, efficient person who never drew attention to herself, a quality that was respected and admired. She was also one of the few mentors who showed some form of dissent at the concept of the Hunger Trials itself, showing that she was supposedly secretly against the idea. She was very caring. Despite her delicacy, she was believed to have some grit.

Lysandra had carefully braided hair and evenly filed nails, contributing to her generally neat appearance. She also had smooth, brown skin. Lysandra was described to have a delicate appearance.','{"source": "Lysistrata Vickers.txt", "charset": "UTF-8", "chunk_id": 1, "position": 1, "chunk_index": 1, "total_chunks": 2, "source_document": "/Users/artem/IdeaProjects/practicum/sprint07/ragbot/./data/replaced/Lysistrata Vickers.txt", "parent_document_id": "540a68a8-ef10-4df0-a250-fae2c45afc67"}','[0.070477076,0.046612334,0.038281225,-0.033829488,0.02855786,-0.022215506,0.0038132893,-0.051646914,-0.0005702759,0.014087054,-0.048317015,-0.086076766,0.05838561,-0.016687687,-0.03976113,-0.012074867,0.066070735,0.01914921,0.013188651,0.064458594,-0.0036391185,0.025030732,-0.025612958,-0.07890429,-0.0124452785,0.013704646,-0.009835306,0.023003826,-0.10531364,0.008247896,0.020279733,-0.012390687,-0.058178134,-0.012383551,-0.0069122687,0.038493767,0.001582938,-0.038284596,0.013207312,-0.019757695,0.009292745,0.027974648,-0.014274388,0.0059535303,-0.0031164344,0.02592567,0.009134844,-0.021153465,0.012641884,-0.017457223,0.0027302708,-0.036481466,-0.013643105,0.009300565,0.02326865,0.011472538,0.00902965,0.010664763,-0.05647831,0.0034524132,-0.013697941,-0.024789276,-0.006887263,0.009220491,0.030342763,-0.02440672,-0.0001636461,-0.005220571,-0.0061891633,0.014395363,0.028207123,0.00071904896,-0.00061844644,-0.01861768,0.007371691,-0.011739062,-0.072903864,-0.024780259,-0.021141103,0.047994085,0.008022815,-0.002501386,0.010990692,-0.025983924,0.029986825,-0.006991277,-0.015015603,0.0020029088,-0.026678974,0.024459884,-0.039272055,0.020650072,0.003544238,0.0374908,0.024840148,-0.03672731,0.01353946,-0.0025460634,-0.046602298,0.029721854,0.012123373,0.036346965,-0.033251327,-0.0031053615,0.017980095,-0.0047435714,0.023038276,-0.027400265,-0.01394804,-0.023529438,-0.027134111,0.008398732,0.011965183,0.044994406,-0.019183662,-0.022345467,0.017189868,0.01599964,0.010481185,0.0645354,-0.0