INSERT INTO public.vector_store (id,"content",metadata,embedding) VALUES
	 ('a4021775-3267-4778-944e-49f00cd70d3d'::uuid,'The Coach allied with the friend and he broke through the foliage surrounding one end of the arena; he discovered the force field surrounding the arena to prevent the tributes from escaping. He wished to investigate further but the friend did not so the two tributes departed ways. Just after the two broke off their alliance, the friend was killed by a flock of birds that pierced her throat and the Coach stayed with her until she died, holding her hand.  

The Coach became one of the last two remaining tributes, the other being a female Elite Tributes from another district. The girl pursued the Coach to the edge of the arena where the force field was located. Both tributes were wounded, but the Coach more so; the female tribute attempted to win the Games by outlasting the Coach. However, the Coach used the force field during the final fight when his adversary threw her ax at him; it was repelled back by the field and killed her. The Coach was crowned victor. However, the leader of the Central City, was furious about the Coach''s trick with the force field, which she would later describe as being "almost as bad as the berries." She wonders what the Central City did to punish the Coach.  

Once they arrive, they are ushered to prepare for the Opening Ceremonies. Right before the ceremony, a tribute from another district hits on her, asking her to divulge her secrets but she brushes him away. After the ceremony, another tribute walks by her naked. She does not understand why everyone is acting weird until the fellow tribute explains that to the Central City, she is "pure" and they are trying to get under her skin, which angers her.  

They go to the rooms where she sees an Mute Servant girl from the 74th Hunger Trials, and also a new Mute Servant, which turns out to be a man from her district, who tried to stop the whipping of her friend. He, like all Mute Servants, was forced to suffer getting his tongue cut out. She is warned by the mentor not to say anything because it would mean punishment for him. Later, the mentor tells them that they must form alliances this year and make friends.  

During training, she befriends two tributes from another district, who point out the force field used to separate the Game Master from the tributes. She displays her archery skills and is wanted by many to be in an alliance. In their solo performances for the Game Master, both the fellow tribute and she are unsure of what to do.  

He goes first, and after a long wait she goes. She doesn''t know what he did, but she can tell that the Game Master are angry. She sees the new Head Game Master, and has an idea. She ties a noose to a dummy and with berry juice writes the name of the former Head Game Master during her Hunger Trials, who let both her and the fellow tribute live. He was executed.  

Afterwards, she finds out that the fellow tribute made a drawing of a past tribute with the flowers on the ground which could not be washed away, and was covered by the Game Master. The mentor is not happy because now they have made enemies. The training scores are shown, and she wonders to her stylist if anyone has ever received a 0. But instead, she and the fellow tribute both receive perfect scores. The mentor explains that this was done to make sure the other tributes are gunning for the both of them. The fellow tribute and she stay together that night, and she has come to accept her death, which she knows will be the spark for the rebellion. That night, both do not have nightmares. The following day, they spend the entire day and night together alone on the roof.  

The day of the interview, the Makeover crew comes into her room and find her and the fellow tribute together.','{"source": "Catching fire.txt", "charset": "UTF-8", "chunk_id": 3, "position": 3, "chunk_index": 3, "total_chunks": 6, "source_document": "/Users/artem/IdeaProjects/practicum/sprint07/ragbot/./data/replaced/Catching fire.txt", "parent_document_id": "3a5fb112-e979-44af-99ae-c8062e764ba8"}','[0.042354226,0.064541735,0.0232457,-0.015651723,-0.013461886,-0.054129265,0.029448051,-0.03434189,-0.030036634,0.0047383886,-0.07473488,-0.07266794,0.008743437,-0.022535833,-0.0063941195,-0.022677395,-0.018616866,0.0611846,-0.0154275475,0.054937072,0.008459831,0.04873786,0.012474509,-0.056097846,0.0108474605,0.008952241,0.043163974,-0.035838258,-0.13117279,-0.009677178,0.023942882,0.019850409,-0.012842232,0.036777295,0.0023037551,0.032329462,0.026569663,0.016133782,0.022508545,-0.025179284,0.00070439937,0.013840034,-0.008613304,0.012419825,0.010717597,0.027764449,0.02004074,-0.039424054,-0.007768948,-0.016813684,0.01081984,-0.031856667,0.0064575216,-0.019693661,0.04570015,0.029475236,-0.02685525,0.005139985,-0.041864768,0.0037468984,-0.0047078184,-0.00872368,0.007948688,0.01722691,0.0058280057,-0.018599475,-0.002660932,-0.007912173,-0.0022226402,0.014945194,0.053646166,-0.034770865,-0.019975115,0.013734613,-0.00087673357,-0.04353228,-0.06410396,-0.053630833,0.0029108804,0.009708785,0.023759572,-0.034061924,-0.01757313,-0.03402549,0.029040076,-0.016426167,-0.024594625,0.009713289,0.0073345476,-0.00013824744,-0.035742402,0.025086442,0.0034419529,0.028506724,0.019717596,-0.006080024,-0.019113896,0.013187495,-0.030634202,0.011912419,0.015935114,0.030699467,-0.0043852017,0.008689967,0.023125181,-0.027646586,-0.0048623313,-0.021173887,-0.006721126,0.0022724685,-0.026986055,0.016957454,0.0028419567,-0.0027613281,-0.033822052,0.009129503,0.02822247,0.015470104,0.012640535,0.024738481,0.02242562,0.0026539702,-0.03911557,0.030597053,-0.0022314645,-0.007185023,0.024558438,0.0075116