	 ('fb11e410-abfe-4fe6-a995-22489be9406f'::uuid,'After their first stop, she climbs the trees to get a look and sees that there are many bodies in the water and on the beach, but she can''t tell who they are.  

As they are walking, searching for drinkable water, she notices a shimmering square and realizes that it is a force field surrounding the arena. Before she can stop him, the fellow tribute walks into it and is repelled back, knocking the older tribute and the other to the ground. He is not breathing. Panicked, she begins to slap him but his heart has stopped. The other tribute offers to help by beginning CPR. She doesn''t realize what he is doing at first and begins fighting him, but he slaps her away and the fellow tribute eventually is resuscitated. He asks her how she recognized the force field. She does not want to let them know she can spot them visually, because the Game Master might do something to','{"source": "Catching fire.txt", "charset": "UTF-8", "chunk_id": 5, "position": 5, "chunk_index": 5, "total_chunks": 6, "source_document": "/Users/artem/IdeaProjects/practicum/sprint07/ragbot/./data/replaced/Catching fire.txt", "parent_document_id": "3a5fb112-e979-44af-99ae-c8062e764ba8"}','[0.0306481,0.053900234,0.007341794,0.04195114,-0.00800869,-0.059547354,-0.02063034,-0.071193025,0.012969234,0.05304697,-0.05032527,-0.037439268,0.034921475,-0.043393787,-0.009176189,0.017906062,0.008659753,0.029082946,-0.005226242,0.077230625,0.0123276105,-0.0013444579,0.017354736,-0.08679014,0.005107645,0.035483398,0.023555206,-0.08009661,-0.08755059,-0.023679128,0.022708226,0.043524917,-0.018331967,0.011673974,-0.030068446,0.016023977,0.024004282,0.0011599071,0.033311743,-0.028764866,0.034163848,0.016090877,-0.0031953584,0.0121500585,0.013945162,0.0016638068,0.019060759,-0.010699355,-0.017064849,-0.0062297685,0.027488992,-0.034437098,0.010970581,-0.015171064,0.07441977,0.012002882,-0.047687385,0.029050982,-0.0383376,0.006418407,-0.018117925,-0.022082837,-0.032275684,0.013647758,0.0059429077,0.0060409824,-0.01817531,0.0048076375,-0.0013542873,-0.01456138,0.031141011,-0.030231548,0.0024340544,0.009954631,0.012951816,-0.062763065,-0.066773385,-0.051130313,0.007865272,0.013054951