	 ('918abcf6-5c85-4fcc-aa7c-d32dcbc31d05'::uuid,'Lena is the secondary antagonist of The Hunger Trials. She was the female tribute from District 8 in the 74th Hunger Trials. A ruthless, sadistic, and highly skilled Career Tribute, Lena became one of the main adversaries in the arena. She was incredibly skilled with knives and could throw them with deadly accuracy.

Lena was a highly feared tribute, both because of her knife-throwing techniques and her ruthlessness; she pursued the Hunger Trials with a sadistic personality. She volunteered for the 74th Hunger Trials. The Career pack stuck together during the training sessions and Lena was usually one of the first to flaunt her skills. She received a high training score.

During the initial bloodbath, she earned the first kill by throwing a knife. She targeted another tribute''s head but was thwarted. The Careers usually team up. They were joined by another tribute later in the Games. He helped them reactivate mines which guarded the pyramid containing the Careers'' supplies.

The night of the bloodbath, the Careers ventured out to hunt for tributes. In his absence, Lena and the other Careers made the decision to keep another tribute alive in the hopes that he would eventually lead them to another. When the Careers found a tribute, they chased her, and she climbed up a tree to safety. Although the Careers tried, they were unable to climb the tree and instead set up camp below. However, while they were distracted, the tribute sawed through a branch that held a tracker jacker nest. The nest dropped down and Lena, along with the others, was stung multiple times. One tribute received enough stings that she died. The tribute then jumped down from the tree after all the other tributes had run away and took a bow and arrows.

Two tributes formed an alliance and planned to destroy the supplies that the Careers had. One had to light fires to make the Careers leave and when the Careers saw the smoke, Lena and others started hunting while the other successfully destroyed all of the remaining Careers'' supplies, after which another tribute was killed out of anger. Lena and another calmed him down long enough to explain that the tribute that destroyed their supplies must have died, so they waited for nightfall. Only then did they realize that the bomber was still alive, so they went hunting.

At the beginning of a feast, Lena went in for a backpack while another scouted the area. When a tribute came to get medicine, Lena threw a knife, slicing her above the eye before tackling her to the ground. The tribute attempted to bite Lena''s hand, but she held the tribute''s head down. Lena asked what was in the bag and expressed hate.

At that point, Lena could have easily killed the tribute, but she made two fatal errors: first, she taunted the tribute about another tribute''s death; second, instead of killing quickly, she wanted to savor the moment, saying that she would give a slow, painful death. She reached into her jacket to select a knife; after much debate, she decided to start with the lips. The tribute spat blood into Lena''s face, making her flush with rage.

Another tribute heard Lena mention the death, quickly yanked her off, and held her a foot above the ground. He then accuses her of the killing, which Lena truthfully denied. When Lena saw him holding a large rock, she screamed for her ally. He smashed the rock into her temple, denting her skull. Her ally ran to her after hearing her cries, but Lena died in his arms as he begged her to stay with him. In another version, the tribute pinned Lena against the Cornucopia before slamming her headfirst against it, cracking her skull. She dropped to the ground, dying soon after the impact.

Lena appeared in a nightmare before a subsequent Hunger Trials.','{"source": "Clove.txt", "charset": "UTF-8", "chunk_id": 0, "position": 0, "chunk_index": 0, "total_chunks": 3, "source_document": "/Users/artem/IdeaProjects/practicum/sprint07/ragbot/./data/replaced/Clove.txt", "parent_document_id": "54424f01-ad80-4ef8-abc7-e903ec378918"}','[0.04496517,0.04097473,0.024370972,-0.021702934,-0.028306706,-0.052808862,0.04764144,-0.046038393,-0.040784426,0.006354738,-0.044692695,-0.076410316,0.053360853,-0.025389701,-0.0397433,-0.018462444,0.04344043,0.026116675,0.004248426,0.039832536,-0.015867272,0.025059765,0.03587986,-0.069032356,0.005258758,0.015299614,0.029896667,-0.024813185,-0.12781052,0.0045304303,0.037833948,0.010108678,0.012508083,0.020406792,-0.030418029,0.015870403,0.026096037,-0.026870422,-0.03574234,-0.013236769,-0.01273654,0.007576903,-0.021592865,0.010471426,0.0031062537,0.028567562,0.013793404,0.002606059,-0.0054705045,-0.023191521,0.034138933,-0.021933252,0.0027546803,0.03147028,0.04329692,-0.0066106715,-0.017510898,0.011721992,0.0074451948,0.0050345026,0.005885213,-0.010022094,0.0005914155,0.01760657,0.01006965,-0.0053535057,-0.0030836994,-0.016112033,-0.026791329,0.0026978338,0.018868735,-0.0013734471,0.023562027,-0.016799103,0.015494815,-0.038470346,-0.054752726,-0.0458394,-0.022863887,0.018049901,0.01377382,0.017557919,-0.004481684,-0.022307562,0.034667958,-0.027196275,-0.0050185956,0.011925004,-0.0057295817,0.02123087,-0.02373744,0.030230876,-0.024639862,0.042481586,0.018698039,-0.0502067,0.007328494,0.0006272887,-0.028343346,0.03248318,-0.0034268142,0.037838586,-0.014643546,-0.005854506,0.0019396975,-0.039798297,-0.013038593,-0.030953782,0.018857332,-0.028620936,-0.038986076,0.003481658,0.0019041215,-0.007975075,-0.018717721,-0.041341987,-0.008997367,0.009410161,-0.004101589,0.06278451,0.032587983,-0.0033499363,-0.021550411,0.03835927,0.009462227,-0.010195129,-0.007989267,-0.007821441,0.011767078,0.0007987107,-0.03917823,-0.031354126,-0.02601574,-0