	 ('0825d5a6-ac8b-4c61-9de3-bb2ae8727ce7'::uuid,'Lena envied that tribute''s training score and hated her for it, more so than her fellow Careers did. In fact, Lena had purposely targeted and almost killed that tribute twice, while the other tributes, including the other Careers, couldn''t at all. At the feast, Lena seemed very joyful after finally subduing the tribute, and reveled sadistically at the prospect of torturing her to death.

