	 ('d3ac0667-cf02-4812-9269-b036320ee4a5'::uuid,'Baker was a Peacekeeper assigned to District 7, where he worked as a cook. He was an old soldier who had lost his left ear in the Crimson Conflict.

At some point he enlisted as a soldier, and he lost his left ear during the Crimson Conflict. He was later assigned to District 7 to cook for the other Sentinel Corps in the base.

