	 ('6a55ee4a-bb69-4be7-baeb-e4ee827487d0'::uuid,'Jax Ramirez was the first governor of District 8. He appeared on the 20 Panar bill, which is prop currency used in a film.

He was an older white man.

It is unknown what precise functions a district''s governor had. It is also unclear how governors were distinct from mayors, and if they came from the district they served, or if they were appointed as overseers. It is possible that certain districts require governors due to their greater population size. It is also possible that governors held the same responsibilities as mayors and that the former is an archaic term.','{"source": "Vick Flemming.txt", "charset": "UTF-8", "chunk_id": 0, "position": 0, "chunk_index": 0, "total_chunks": 1, "source_document": "/Users/artem/IdeaProjects/practicum/sprint07/ragbot/./data/replaced/Vick Flemming.txt", "parent_document_id": "214a28f3-7d55-4373-bb1a-f8b9c7fd6048"}','[0.0015676155,0.07534121,-0.043666147,-0.04208436,-0.013569417,-0.028588805,-0.02485477,0.05348162,-0.045509767,0.01369613,0.03514839,-0.05163111,0.077898584,-0.060899083,0.010986361,0.004840482,0.0067031397,0.054237645,-0.017703298,0.029088441,0.024245335,-0.001194901,0.050199553,-0.0068245344,-0.015938006,0.030111026,-0.020374086,0.0063182833,-0.0443501,0.0055060796,0.0434708,-0.041262474,-0.021372125,0.04606501,-0.04419741,0.037467126,-0.023792217,0.038768206,0.020686824,-0.007868746,-0.008976817,-0.005083131,-0.026482847,0.017078515,0.013398915,0.01924145,-0.011732106,-0.03349035,-0.015830345,-0.036581296,-0.023059333,-0.05002006,0.03670473,-0.015344244,-0.013977075,-0.023486173,-0.015083109,0.0065070726,0.046882134,0.012766188,-0.05137651,0.01564319,0.012529425,0.03156603,-0.01784847,-0.01995792,0.025110241,-0.047539607,-0.016634153,-0.033387557,0.021547288,-0.0023832882,0.012118661,-0.033786364,0.028175691,0.0248848,-0.0598588,-0.038218044,0.017947903,0.0024092249,0.026971284,0.0080307005,-0.05270747,0.0045132595,0.03998678,-0.00026141535,-0.014510146,-0.0015117783,0.00056000834,0.0049703503,0.01503637,-0.009748383,0.016781453,0.023898205,0.0046607265,0.01303066,-0.00314777,0.013865314,-0.020916948,0.009314349,-0.015847959,0.0361574,-0.030096447,0.02533267,0