	 ('624f7a7c-9387-4c53-aa48-a37c732f374b'::uuid,'Oscar was a tribute from District 12 for the The Hunger Games: Ten. He was male and between 12 and 18 years old. His weapon was a crossbow. He died before the Hunger Trials started.

During a tour of the arena before the start of the Hunger Trials, rebel bombs exploded, killing him. His body was later draped on a horse and paraded down a road during a funeral.

In a film adaptation, he survived until the arena. He shot another tribute with a crossbow. He later hidden under rubble and was killed offscreen.','{"source": "Otto.txt", "charset": "UTF-8", "chunk_id": 0, "position": 0, "chunk_index": 0, "total_chunks": 1, "source_document": "/Users/artem/IdeaProjects/practicum/sprint07/ragbot/./data/replaced/Otto.txt", "parent_document_id": "034f3466-9126-46e1-968e-cd5116321f13"}','[0.027977921,0.05467094,0.042401932,-0.00030411346,-0.039970037,-0.04832692,0.012344835,0.00948907,-0.04563605,0.014953566,-0.0232488,-0.058999844,0.060195014,-0.024548406,-0.03502206,-0.058670733,0.033544343,0.063506044,0.0016344032,0.062014714,0.0044974517,0.03623107,-0.010684604,-0.057601634,0.034618344,0.037589468,0.01677231,-0.0067174337,-0.109353244,-0.052281607,0.040699847,0.021017602,-0.0128882695,0.03624153,-0.031461462,0.0019419534,0.0074255727,0.0389919,0.0034428285,-0.0130622275,0.010825338,-0.0066440785,0.004659388,0.01779788,-0.019566396,0.018754276,0.025408572,-0.030900262,-0.021345295,-0.027522195,0.008020481,-0.057150893,-0.006304565,-0.0004738794,0.05139095,0.014416205,-0.000901363,0.036799535,-0.0013737312,-0.0041734283,-0.023683183,0.016740078,0.016280906,0.023440039,-0.007841264,-0.041758653,-0.012098873,-0.007691208,0.016329948,0.019102037,0.037313618,0.02318648,0.00976836,0.013847884,0.019354176,-0.011767958,-0.05598002,-0.045307435,-0.007703279,0.0026758872,0.033967253,-0.028416421,-0.036955103,-0.039208267,0.007392071,-0.05088502,-0.00791348,0.021772863,0.017753754,0.0011058591,-0.021855079,0.01572115,-0.053493574,0.021262525,-0.00704146,-0.029641407,0.018676857,0.04474741,-0.05360504,0.016706362,0.0023604175,0.058837004,-0.018954735,-0.0011021314,-0.006522733,-0.03045525,-0.003034271,-0.006167148,0.01785356,-0.030659746,-0.028698971,-0.049073644,0.019155556,0.031554863,-0.015961451,0.009708024,-0.021888906,0.009619627,0.024180975,0.06339468,0.031269647,0.0053044786,-0.016227406,0.045604635,-0.009257582,-0.00080055866,-0.005479