	 ('e491c775-055d-4f89-9088-c2387dce73c6'::uuid,'He single-handedly supports his three younger siblings and his mother. His father died in a mine accident. He originally supported his family by illegally hunting and applying for extra rations. When he becomes too old for the competition, he works in the same mines as his father used to. Even though his friend wants to help him, he refuses every coin she offers. He does allow his friend to bring in game from hunts that he can no longer join, but expresses antagonism towards this arrangement as well. His friend and her family are just like family to him, as they look out for each other and share many things in common. He saves his friend''s mother and sister and about eight hundred other citizens when the ruling power bombs their home.

He has black hair, olive skin, and grey eyes. He was over six feet tall by a young age. Due to their common heritage, he and his friend appear so alike that people believe them to be cousins. His eyebrows are heavy and dark, and he has stubble on his chin. His lips are soft and full but slightly chapped.

Muscular and good-looking, his friend herself says that he would have no trouble finding a wife. Another character calls him gorgeous and another says that he is one of very few people with camera-ready faces. His hands are scarred, but are strong and precise. In the winter, he smells of leather, apples, and smoke. He is often seen carrying a militarized bow.','{"source": "Gale Hawthorne.txt", "charset": "UTF-8", "chunk_id": 4, "position": 4, "chunk_index": 4, "total_chunks": 5, "source_document": "/Users/artem/IdeaProjects/practicum/sprint07/ragbot/./data/replaced/Gale Hawthorne.txt", "parent_document_id": "21055cb7-aa05-49e5-9d9b-f49624485bb3"}','[0.04890593,0.06391679,0.024248675,0.014275081,-0.022037843,-0.08512916,0.020996122,-0.010144357,-0.013327666,-0.018220631,-0.0445028,-0.015621728,0.036251344,-0.043359324,-0.0130480975,-0.0068699364,0.03350085,0.016540648,0.0542881,0.082497925,0.04187332,0.01615215,0.040766865,-0.109219395,0.008265772,0.046804022,0.01948542,0.03749134,-0.071280606,-0.0068008667,0.04279326,-0.017169584,-0.04035141,-0.0066106035,-0.002642634,0.036115963,-0.0012107677,0.010718206,0.026616912,-0.032642208,-0.0035119343,0.022310305,-0.00982157,0.008593542,0.005042863,-0.03601872,0.003314082,-0.026331056,0.032107383,0.0053676344,0.010421669,-0.02990945,-0.038874697,0.03284943,0.040053323,-0.014362277,0.0060579497,0.027427023,-0.021158885,0.022446847,-0.0032139583,0.023505697,-0.0039107157,0.019852545,0.013755385,-0.0040420694,0.00043798488,-0.00031525592,-0.015476083,-0.005852797,0.009982588,0.020893062,-0.032131016,0.018216688,-0.0076041524,-0.049742416,-0.079293914,-0.047205202,-0.024723975,0.000887829,-0.02724341,-0.021401148,-0.048550192,-0.06041369,0.018482078,-0.05010423,-0.014271094,-0.0060086213,-0.0012035092,0.013272576,-0.0033954144,0.0063844044,0.0172791,0.02382428,0.015979616,0.03936341,0.0037717265,0.03744708,-0.02308724,-0.009640627,0.002081582,0.026469484,-0.029502107,-0.00820575,-0.014117343,-0.0186955,-0.02287359,-0.026307229,