	 ('391e3170-8ecb-4bdd-98c1-c4271526082b'::uuid,'For the first time in the history of the Games, muttations were unleashed in the arena in the form of rainbow-colored snakes, specially bred by the Head Gamemaker.

Ultimately, the Head Gamemaker considered these Games a disaster, presenting the Capitol as far too vulnerable. She erased all recordings of the Games, keeping only a master copy in her own personal vault for her own purposes.

This is the first games where a victor was from District 7. The district would not have a second victor for another forty years.','{"source": "10th Hunger Games.txt", "charset": "UTF-8", "chunk_id": 5, "position": 5, "chunk_index": 5, "total_chunks": 6, "source_document": "/Users/artem/IdeaProjects/practicum/sprint07/ragbot/./data/replaced/10th Hunger Games.txt", "parent_document_id": "9b0010b8-1638-440d-8b2f-8f53d65a079f"}','[0.01871421,0.06571412,-0.021612974,-0.007094499,0.01134909,-0.054509044,-0.017803768,-0.009001058,-0.024482379,0.019663138,-0.048339985,-0.02922428,0.011402548,-0.0017337715,-0.03065031,-0.045258272,0.044270128,0.06761698,-0.037141044,0.06353854,-0.007954992,0.009969948,-0.023533575,-0.06923306,0.01404984,0.026414784,0.0148287965,-0.0058678687,-0.12262177,-0.055357195,0.018255781,0.025412524,0.021597452,0.013096128,-0.0023359496,0.02972144,-0.015578117,0.02821268,0.0048616454,-0.026313882,-0.007934078,-0.0107704615,0.0328904,0.0032927208,0.002601402,0.03206662,0.05085017,-0.021033054,0.0154504925,-0.010528776,0.035663456,-0.04603508,-0.023566928,0.043032803,0.0085868,0.01982163,-0.031959202,0.006300611,-0.027022656,0.010691633,-0.037633233,0.0123342965,0.009488139,0.040055465,-0.0069473665,-0.026348429,-0.019390637,-0.033900194,-0.010302319,0.016863681,0.06340414,-0.021984389,0.026944442,-0.0019055404,0.025104426,-0.022303926,-0.06334914,-0.040676303,0.02102012,0.013809598,0.017117111,-0.033236045,-0.04627325,-0.031890206,0.011595585,-0.020328145,0.013869969,0.0011077544,0.031593937,0.0036556365,-0.016657056,0.03307266,-0.011799487,0.020207994,0.006681108,-0.06001391,0.044836245,-0.0012056661,-0.026357278,0.02457474,-0.0010422624,0.004683956,-0.029866656,0.012534513,0.02285312,0.004798993,0.0021670277,0.0019596636,0.026843825,-0.03393452,-0.008191554,-0.0021614195,-0.007023082,0.012297443,-0.028030142,-0.008579733,0.00092485844,0.016360935,0.035163984,0.035087913,-0.0034649845,-0.012526764,-0.024245098,0.03464172,-0.0004950198,0.008680123,-0.0