	 ('66301859-ef8c-4fa9-964f-f39c6fac637c'::uuid,'Frost Coat is a mixture of snow and numbing agents. It is not recognized as a real "medicine", but it uses medicine to reduce pain. Frost Coat is not widely used, mainly because it can only be used seasonally, when snow is available.

Frost Coat is made in a bowl, and looks like a bunch of snow but with a slight light green tint. This is caused by herbal juice, the second ingredient in snow coat. It gives off a clean and sweet smell.

Frost Coat can treat lacerations and swelling, reducing the pain of hurt flesh and skin. Even though it''s not a real medicine, it is more convenient with cheaper ingredients. The cold also numbs the skin like an ice pack.
An individual''s wound has to set before snow coat can be used. When treating a patient with snow coat, the clothes or bandages on the wounded areas are removed before the treatment. Then a clean piece of cloth is laid upon the skin and the mixture is spread out on the cloth. The patient''s pain is described as "sizzling away".','{"source": "Snow coat.txt", "charset": "UTF-8", "chunk_id": 0, "position": 0, "chunk_index": 0, "total_chunks": 1, "source_document": "/Users/artem/IdeaProjects/practicum/sprint07/ragbot/./data/replaced/Snow coat.txt", "parent_document_id": "5eae338d-f9d7-4d51-b072-cbdec89727f5"}','[-0.046330344,0.009972794,0.018253699,0.04192279,-0.011545622,-0.0687346,-0.017290736,0.0010544673,-0.0025836881,0.018491078,-0.041310742,0.01422814,0.036798712,-0.045173574,-0.026339764,-0.024544869,0.018820353,0.016871864,0.04705821,0.06234105,0.0737164,-0.03088804,-0.013887235,0.008272612,0.035268288,0.10226957,0.0029465437,-0.027996575,-0.058671135,0.050825678,0.041101005,-0.00940586,0.030284965,0.00069363683,-0.047194324,0.019156475,0.01412843,0.020094113,0.02392501,-0.029483585,0.014907338,-0.0053228615,0.025920484,-0.018198173,0.015141804,-0.016273644,-0.025483128,0.008351956,-0.011002034,-0.010192528,-0.02761952,-0.048182737,0.00550062,-0.016642448,0.0123439655,0.005544264,-0.020831624,0.041620884,0.012641273,-0.0037920817,-0.00543447,0.0002755582,0.031563826,0.048410468,-0.008035611,-0.005364069,0.05682081,-0.024590923,-0.004663217,0.04849007,0.003500216,-0.037283804,0.0134319,0.024333777,-0.040550776,-0.010652731,-0.06916091,-0.011763884,0.01963311,-0.0018399949,0.0029138075,-0.025122901,-0.018964352,-0.0058478876,-0.012672016,0.01079331,-0.004045032,-0.012672367,-0.022392338,-0.0028928993,0.0068688374,0.02097435,-0.014298931,0.026449213,-0.0076042754,-0.014783484,0.040481035,-0.021393627,-0.02416842,-0.0011274607,0.01170986,0.0010112163,0.011303383,-0.009705773,-0.004398779,-0.0028965683,-0.056544293,-0.021962825,0.020746246,0.012511781,-0.017449042,0.