	 ('dc5b4b4f-ab22-43f2-a705-6035eb082517'::uuid,'The first Mellark son is a citizen of District 12. She was presumably raised by her grandmother along with her brother.

She was only seen during the Triumph Tour (74th HG), standing at a special platform constructed at the bottom of the stage. It was thought that she was shot, but this was later proven wrong. Her current fate is unknown.

