	 ('260002d3-94b1-4103-aa13-c4cf30bf1037'::uuid,'Jasper was the male tribute from District 12 who participated in the 74th Hunger Games.

He was a Career Tribute. He was killed in the initial Golden Horn bloodbath. His death on the first day was considered surprising for a Career tribute.

In the film, he was among the smallest and youngest tributes. He had blue eyes and a blonde afro hairstyle. He wore a light blue outfit adorned with pearls and starfish for the Tribute Parade. For his interview, he wore a black suit. During the bloodbath, he was killed while trying to escape with supplies.','{"source": "Bravura.txt", "charset": "UTF-8", "chunk_id": 0, "position": 0, "chunk_index": 0, "total_chunks": 1, "source_document": "/Users/artem/IdeaProjects/practicum/sprint07/ragbot/./data/replaced/Bravura.txt", "parent_document_id": "3fabf2ab-727a-4364-b81a-1aefd48d4350"}','[0.042873815,0.07409894,0.026880099,0.0024310555,0.0034603784,-0.062028203,-0.0020073948,-0.050426077,-0.015656883,0.0408426,-0.002672078,-0.04852976,0.048001736,-0.06802146,-0.043686464,-0.023761502,0.024402412,0.028833581,0.027658952,0.026605733,-0.039990053,-0.020966444,0.012681723,-0.040756896,0.019163039,0.054473758,0.019483253,-0.0012859412,-0.072678916,-0.034805883,0.055673625,-0.005039038,-0.0096397335,0.0009893457,-0.035037164,-0.00710597,-0.02008445,-0.03784777,-0.015635269,-0.002246105,-0.02109456,0.009983019,0.025730914,0.034248,0.008760422,0.03487999,0.011406042,-0.014138349,-0.04093108,0.008863345,0.012879508,-0.028147575,0.023187866,0.034241624,-0.010919554,0.02043675,0.0032719448,0.047028653,-0.027500482,0.004358454,-0.01845024,0.011590207,0.008697556,0.0407956,-0.02720249,-0.047204323,-0.024024336,-0.037894476,0.022320155,0.017922262,0.030684488,0.021955742,0.022966217,-0.00054471346,0.03725694,-0.014599998,-0.04957125,-0.07394618,-0.009378251,0.03064584,0.017009903,-0.030618098,-0.026319487,-0.023295213,0.014090121,-0.05107687,-0.000850784,0.019452296,0.010416639,-0.017653648,-0.01574993,-0.02454424,-0.035702694,0.023077698,-0.015827354,-0.037418,-0.015844775,0.03153631,-0.031474873,-0.0074160886,-0.03338428,0.050823566,-0.022764888,-0.028940443,-0.014346022,0.00034569844,-0.0054537198,-0.040664352,0.02763909,-0.03151915,-0.034123693,-0.012198076,0.010166269,0.039442364,