	 ('aeb40f6d-7172-4114-9edc-404553624202'::uuid,'Eli Vance was a resident of District 7 and a member of the Coalitions. He was a standout player on his mandolin, performing with lightning-fast fingering while keeping his facial features expressionless and distant.

He was found as a baby and taken in by the traveling Coalitions. He learned to play the mandolin and performed along with the rest of the group. He was a tall, rawboned young man who wore a feathered hat during performances.

He was skilled with his hands, fashioning items such as a butter churn and fishing equipment. He later became a very skilled and sought-after blacksmith, and many in District 7 owned his creations. One of his creations was a Rebellion Pin.','{"source": "Tam Amber.txt", "charset": "UTF-8", "chunk_id": 0, "position": 0, "chunk_index": 0, "total_chunks": 1, "source_document": "/Users/artem/IdeaProjects/practicum/sprint07/ragbot/./data/replaced/Tam Amber.txt", "parent_document_id": "ed9e5012-98a4-41c4-beb4-13b3582a3623"}','[0.055695795,0.045222804,0.026320137,0.012927297,-0.015086155,-0.083354004,0.0075813564,0.018618478,0.0111322375,0.02816691,-0.028342424,-0.058873348,0.03617312,0.025932087,-0.030905757,-0.017850386,0.05899011,0.039147243,0.03813883,0.06813449,-0.002610764,0.033761647,0.052068032,-0.011593265,-0.0039635305,-0.0034970597,0.025189599,0.027753683,-0.07388965,0.03851378,0.037171014,-0.056281026,-0.037298866,0.016801119,-0.017995764,0.04077972,0.018886944,-0.012728162,0.023993192,-0.018072437,-0.00914665,-0.009657329,0.022582749,-0.017170163,0.002243377,0.017933272,-0.032687705,-0.02763165,-0.0065431185,0.012553088,-0.0039804443,-0.05817952,-0.010623878,0.010486408,0.022198059,-0.024151588,0.025876986,-0.022145487,-0.0018138367,-0.013286976,-0.012270912,0.025277978,-0.023867784,0.06851882,0.0032895692,-0.011707138,0.018214805,-0.03204926,-0.011761762,0.01517663,0.044669006,-0.000815518,-0.001274986,-0.010725527,0.009095805,0.00914015,-0.053037677,-0.035603065,0.003340419,0.06326788,-0.009504122,0.008667882,-0.042254508,-0.022690915,0.0046819104,-0.03975552,0.02660137,0.009004119,-0.033523604,-0.00835199,-0.012023634,0.03336484,-0.019301005,0.020960204,-0.012380139,-0.024167484,0.020432867,-0.016990693,-0.043267705,0.00015057054,0.008928546,0.042096563,-0.04042516,-0.0016225193,0.033995707,-0.033464465,-0.00124338,-0.021862438,-0.023772117,-0.04432371,-0.01274606,-0.008641979,-0.03136602,0.020601012,-0.009411618,-0.005292369,-0.023522757,0.04276432,0.024977