	 ('8274aca9-9314-4b6d-87ef-39839a5c7b88'::uuid,'They were large, bulky dogs with sparse fur, short muzzles, and powerful jaws, and they ran on all fours.

Five wolf mutts were associated with fallen tributes during the attack. They included one with silky waves of blond fur and green eyes, a small one with red fur and amber eyes, one with ashen hair and hazel eyes, the smallest mutt with dark, glossy fur and huge brown eyes, and one that jumped very high.

Four mutts were killed by one tribute: two unidentified, and the two associated with specific fallen tributes. Another tribute killed the unknown mutt that bit them, and the fallen tribute managed to kill at least one more while fighting for life on the ground. They killed at least six mutts altogether, but there could have been as many as 21 wolves total in the pack, since it was believed they were all of the other tributes.

In the novel, the wolf mutts never actually killed anyone, but they mauled one tribute horribly and wounded another to the point that a leg amputation was needed. In the film, they killed a tribute, and they did not attack another tribute for long before a mercy killing occurred.','{"source": "Wolf mutt.txt", "charset": "UTF-8", "chunk_id": 1, "position": 1, "chunk_index": 1, "total_chunks": 2, "source_document": "/Users/artem/IdeaProjects/practicum/sprint07/ragbot/./data/replaced/Wolf mutt.txt", "parent_document_id": "f8750402-96b8-4e94-8cf6-739acc5e95b3"}','[-0.00052020024,0.04500577,0.0076250234,0.021660708,0.0029669125,-0.0063021216,0.015998488,-0.040973056,-0.016147947,-0.0020152426,-0.07445877,-0.022533383,0.056097236,-0.027198669,-0.040749732,0.0073486553,0.031158755,0.015173608,0.024153963,0.085761376,0.0072581526,0.002535552,0.008520856,-0.06285211,0.04292203,0.031101795,0.00169426,0.0011704321,-0.08079033,-0.050044935,0.0650146,0.02090437,-0.022735422,0.028429387,-0.0036660908,-0.010632012,0.011451458,0.017425131,-0.0044364017,-0.06316566,0.0044844584,-0.01691164,0.0148884915,-0.009915144,-0.01005085,0.0056741266,0.012747981,-0.008547211,-0.0062771128,-0.02210885,0.025217598,-0.021409787,-0.027223544,0.025135845,0.05018253,0.01623995,-0.024126824,0.022665698,-0.008096745,0.011920179,-0.018995414,-0.008736246,0.005051084,0.00084217836,-0.0044937264,-0.05425863,-0.008617201,-0.059754524,0.022038255,0.024335744,0.05473215,-0.019980926,0.02003213,0.015202606,-0.018655118,0.002119042,-0.06630959,-0.054577943,0.0071501723,-0.01857649,-0.01565688,-0.044267986,0.002433852,-0.009278442,0.043362897,-0.065255575,-0.018756527,0.00107643,0.024740046,0.06433359,-0.031882755,0.010667426,-0.004224312,0.026050158,-0.008453861,-0.037731487,0.030854108,0.015346036,-0.03956848,0.009427035,-0.0068576047,-0.003988627,-0.055708744,-0.017405933,0.013633714,-0.004460342,0.0012092001,0.0019430338,0.017140431,-0.018605823,-0.039694063,-0.031031812,0.03975391,0.024743013,0.013416669,