	 ('e86871e3-af32-4343-8f6f-76ea5e0d8127'::uuid,'The Fire Games: Tribute Manual is the first of the official tie-in books to The Fire Games film. It is a tie-in book.

Here is the ultimate guide to the twenty-four Contestants participating in the annual Hunger Games.
The Tribute Guide mainly covers what tributes undergo before entering the arena. It features portraits of all the tributes, an overview of the districts, and includes many filming photos.','{"source": "The Hunger Games_ Tribute Guide.txt", "charset": "UTF-8", "chunk_id": 0, "position": 0, "chunk_index": 0, "total_chunks": 1, "source_document": "/Users/artem/IdeaProjects/practicum/sprint07/ragbot/./data/replaced/The Hunger Games_ Tribute Guide.txt", "parent_document_id": "e49d3064-9459-45d7-8e0b-0ca6e92742ea"}','[0.062530264,0.046543945,-0.011237332,-0.026115935,-0.045908045,-0.01764155,0.026097307,0.011030554,-0.0093693305,0.026994258,-0.03171327,-0.06614051,0.06383927,-0.004245686,0.003669643,-0.03647193,0.002900376,0.029286152,-0.008417404,0.057400115,-0.013982538,0.07013873,-0.02918228,0.0018672922,0.044190403,0.012800044,0.025273481,-0.009560787,-0.07347087,-0.04543732,0.024894686,0.05835079,-0.019121494,0.03561476,-0.020504162,0.026732454,-0.008403519,0.06186109,0.0005742466,1.5390277e-05,0.042525556,-0.0033393747,-0.012338582,0.04385952,0.026984483,0.018745774,0.010499643,-0.014759882,0.010372741,-0.013994543,-0.0008819308,-0.03189394,-0.022581011,-0.016515212,0.017463546,0.005403136,0.0026396015,0.01867569,-0.047686476,-0.034241423,-0.015938072,-0.0047551435,0.024056766,0.0315625,-0.014988595,-0.014913618,-0.01088362,0.010209621,-0.00903841,0.027937666,0.046439115,0.010665492,0.041351847,0.025923377,-0.035848536,-0.0476497,-0.04669931,-0.026931405,0.008177837,0.016703894,0.033415493,-0.04409606,-0.011898565,-0.036226247,0.009889865,-0.037004065,-0.008726223,0.011313419,0.013525637,-0.0057942616,-0.026868308,0.054842964,-0.04698042,0.03863645,0.013731632,0.029333184,0.02075007,-0.0028023527,-0.022718674,0.022052897,-0.03186249,0.02118964,0.026119154,0.007992986,0.0068798573,0.0027978611,-0.00831917,-0.037173625,0.042074375,-0.0045873774,-0.004354146,-0.030715698,0.043104332,0.040245526,-0.01911665,-0.0077361083,-0.0029944093,0.01016409,0.025278853,0.042524375,