	 ('b3245700-2c84-4b2d-9525-88e791b88a59'::uuid,'Unlike the previous two, the captive''s third propo was aired live. He was made to recount war damage allegedly perpetrated by rebels: a broken dam, a derailed train leaking toxic waste, a granary collapsed after a fire, and the bombing of a water purification plant. The rebels were able to break into the broadcast with their own "We Remember" propos. After wresting control back from the rebels, the enemy leader asked the captive if he had any parting thoughts for the star, and the captive revealed that the Capitol was planning to bomb the rebel district. After that, he was knocked to the floor and beaten, and the footage cut out.

In one instance, a speech was written that was later given by the enemy leader on television. He declared that any association with the rebellion''s symbol would be punishable by death; to prove it, Peacekeepers staged live executions before crowds in two districts at the same instant. When the members of the elite squad were all mistakenly declared dead, the enemy leader appeared on television, commending Peacekeepers for ridding the nation of the The Final Ember. He derided the star as a poor, unstable girl with a small talent. Then, through his doubt in her, he expressed that the rebels had no real leader among them. This was interrupted by a rebel broadcast, after which the enemy leader declared that when they recovered the star''s body, the rebels would see her for what she truly was: a dead girl who could save no one, not even herself.','{"source": "Propo.txt", "charset": "UTF-8", "chunk_id": 2, "position": 2, "chunk_index": 2, "total_chunks": 3, "source_document": "/Users/artem/IdeaProjects/practicum/sprint07/ragbot/./data/replaced/Propo.txt", "parent_document_id": "cf13b0dd-0d84-4a33-928f-20f1f45c8075"}','[-0.032922827,0.053854678,6.5901215e-05,0.04379405,-0.009246716,-0.017425463,-0.046146918,0.022475298,-0.075651266,0.025922947,-0.08416264,-0.068326294,0.065813944,-0.07250491,-0.0028019508,0.01201432,0.05286495,-0.0007269486,-0.03760232,0.042980947,-0.010741551,0.026696926,-0.009762881,-0.06265202,-0.034671128,0.017868305,0.01626644,-0.008550845,-0.10380777,0.037419945,0.003417259,-0.012789588,0.010189659,0.04399512,0.011790141,0.030442756,-0.010344321,0.014890694,0.00019030311,-3.573798e-05,-0.018584488,-0.017240578,0.011769722,0.012899818,0.005993113,0.015086205,-0.013609142,-0.024062028,-0.018100265,-0.015711213,0.019350182,-0.050358426,-0.0064556957,-0.02061325,0.03599976,0.025093647,0.0072614825,0.02726698,-0.038630314,0.0025300134,-0.019769667,0.004832044,-0.023037484,0.0066326107,0.0052647176,-0.009412363,0.002458451,-0.046885356,-0.0026211303,-0.01