	 ('bf0c146c-0e47-42b1-8df0-a2c58a73ced3'::uuid,'Her bows were handcrafted by her father and carefully wrapped in waterproof covers. She had multiple that she kept hidden. Her father had originally made her a smaller‑sized bow to use when she was younger, but she soon progressed to using the full‑size bow. The homemade bow appears to be a version of a flatbow—a bow made from a single piece of wood, but shorter than a longbow and with flattened limbs.

The archery station in the training facility contains bows of many different materials, including wood, plastic, and metal. The arrows have perfectly‑cut feathers that are uniform in shape. However, the bowstring and arrows were far more rigid than she was used to. In one arena, the single bow is silver, while another arena had a golden bow that she immediately spotted.

The inventor was tasked with designing her special black bow. She described it as having exquisite balance and elegant design; to her, the curve of the limbs suggested the wings of a bird in flight. His assignment was to make it purely for aesthetics, but he left the outside simple. He also designed three varieties of arrows: razor‑sharp, incendiary and explosive, which were color‑coded by their shafts. Armed with this, she could accurately shoot targets over a great distance.

She tried to teach her sister how to shoot, but the results were disastrous. She also considered giving another character archery lessons. Before an event, she gave an hour of archery lessons to an ally in exchange for an hour of instruction with another weapon.','{"source": "Bow and Arrow.txt", "charset": "UTF-8", "chunk_id": 1, "position": 1, "chunk_index": 1, "total_chunks": 2, "source_document": "/Users/artem/IdeaProjects/practicum/sprint07/ragbot/./data/replaced/Bow and Arrow.txt", "parent_document_id": "74b0fa1c-9965-4820-ba23-316d2c1a96c5"}','[-0.0062145907,0.033550423,0.08190836,0.002258675,-0.047448177,-0.055444382,0.018914733,0.003307441,-0.052145354,0.0068251807,-0.051587265,0.044842172,0.04686299,0.023301015,-0.0009194303,-0.0015843909,-0.0026045635,0.101658106,0.06508768,0.06950444,-0.006037428,0.022753328,0.013842819,-0.046052653,-0.015821537,0.024960332,0.016851896,-0.0092673395,-0.11724936,-0.023519417,0.024075495,-0.016783616,-0.014904229,-0.006528637,0.0072895894,0.017808639,-0.0024726938,0.0021053532,0.029039163,-0.068092905,0.008941077,0.042985745,0.006448011,-0.013518642,0.019307237,0.024549976,0.003590082,-0.035341967,-0.0030386094,0.028665446,0.043041464,-0.054018915,-0.004227361,0.008025445,0.044295914,0.0104527045,-0.0038451585,0.01207187,-0.011863439,-0.017903175,0.0055075972,-0.01167914,0.022480642,0.04124762,-0.023132024,0.029980764,0.010914552,-0.009628645,-0.0016387748,0.031212484,0.016983336,-0.0037204584,-0.012431929,0.039675206,0.019841846,-0.044645224,-0.07136932,-0.043212876,-0.020385733,0.009540056,-0.009092394,-0.026914679,-0.03400908,-0.01652104,0.037339225,-0.013297103,-0.017366163,0.01691456,-0.0059819575,0.026308864,-0.013222942,-0.0033989532,-0.01735801,-0.006381115,-0.023348285,0.005909364,-0.003388215,0.004341922,-0.036892254,0.02076185,-0.0013937025,0.02161487,-0.010174439,-0.02065697,0.023932034,-0.025544675,-0.029166313,-0.017993847,-0.0031760423,-0.019263458,-0.010719737,0.019220773,0.03045069,-0.008917696,-0.018109811