	 ('33ffcbca-9b03-493e-b1d6-3ac9a6899ab6'::uuid,'When Mutt Serpents were released into the arena, she panicked. She screamed and jumped from her chair. Afraid that she would reveal the story of the snakes to the others, her partner wrapped his arms around her from behind to comfort or confine her. She went rigid but silent as he comforted her, stating that she was entirely safe from the Mutt Serpents. As another tribute walked out into the arena in view of the cameras, he let her go.

Afterward, the remaining mentors slept in the hall. At dawn, her partner observed her still awake and fingering her collarbone. Intending on making amends once more, he asked if her scales were fading, to which she replied that they had, but commented it may take a full year to disappear completely. She then apologised, revealing that the source of her recent erratic and abnormal behavior was a result of her fear. The pair then shared food whilst the others were sleeping and conversed. As they washed their faces to prepare for the day, she loaned him her soap, a gesture that he considered to symbolise her forgiveness toward him. Almost back to normal, she began sending her tribute more gifts, although her tribute ignored them all.

As the tributes reduced to the final two, both she and her partner refused to eat food given to them out of nervousness. Eventually, her tribute died from poison, and her partner was celebrated for his tribute''s victory. She most likely participated in the celebrations before her partner was taken away. Following her partner''s disqualification, it is said that she would get a prize at graduation.

In a film adaptation, she volunteered to create the proposal with her partner. The next morning, she attempted to take full credit for the writing and fell off a tall platform housing the Mutt Serpents after being bitten. Unlike the source material, she dies from the snake bite.

She was considered to be the prettiest girl in her year at the Academy before the snake attack occurred. She had golden brown skin and raven hair that reached over her shoulders.

After she was bitten by the Mutt Serpents, her skin was peeling and her eyes were the color of egg yolks. She was also affected by twitching across her entire body, and part of her skin was mottled with bright scales.

She showed tact and studiously made a note in her binder upon learning of her tribute.

She was extremely popular with both the students and faculty of the Academy, due to her kindness. This served to excuse an occasional rudeness, such as not raising her hand before asking a question of an instructor.

She was shown to be kind and rather humble, as when she showed her hysteric behavior after the snake incident, others observed that the behavior was abnormal coming from her, with one deducing that her behavior was a result of the snake venom. She was kind and forgiving, apologizing multiple times for her comments and her behavior, and was shown to be considerate, as she always apologized to others and considered what she would do better. As an example, she apologized for yelling at her partner for writing the essay overnight after another''s death, commenting that others handled grief differently.','{"source": "Clemensia Dovecote.txt", "charset": "UTF-8", "chunk_id": 1, "position": 1, "chunk_index": 1, "total_chunks": 2, "source_document": "/Users/artem/IdeaProjects/practicum/sprint07/ragbot/./data/replaced/Clemensia Dovecote.txt", "parent_document_id": "d139c248-e522-4b78-ac35-284f2aae6c74"}','[0.010480149,0.048845608,0.05246866,-0.016473193,0.016275264,-0.06704274,0.017738964,0.002486034,-0.024641568,0.032531954,-0.04781571,-0.030680815,0.023257589,-0.025732638,-0.038861375,0.019846635,0.02274084,0.016648298,0.004893262,0.093502365,-0.0021992584,0.00995563,0.016514616,-0.094347574,0.022801446,0.027005142,-0.015803555,0.024674144,-0.0948271,-0.0014505446,0.016583286,0.06021667,-0.019603854,0.033509076,-0.0018970144,0.011470995,0.023722764,-0.01645103,0.018186789,-0.049086094,0.00029371024,0.031133328,-0.005345603,0.016754877,0.008696885,-0.0034159692,0.004042329,-0.02830339,-0.014746558,-0.00887708,0.019680498,-0.03294398,-0.008166756,0.036120985,0.025701847,0.02706203,0.0044030235,0.009102696,-0.04511968,-0.031360023,-0.02463561,-0.025182,0.02215246,0.022945393,0.00464321,-0.038065344,-0.012608767,-0.037958723,-0.026483485,0.016688649,0.04481292,-0.00452303,0.0008110805,0.007513087,-0.007036687,-0.05800269,-0.06844105,-0.0422654,-0.009553314,0.001899384,-0.0046770032,-0.0041709463,-0.015738925,-0.017402856,0.024174908,-0.043785125,0.010792381,0.0023844526,-0.0204