	 ('505c049f-9d68-4109-9ab8-a1709946507b'::uuid,'The Final Ember may refer to:

The Final Ember - the third and final book in a trilogy.
The Final Ember (bird) - a fictitious bird.
Eagle Accord - a deal struck so that a character would become the figurehead of a rebellion.
Rebellion Pin - a pin worn as a tribute token.
Phoenix suit - an outfit designed and worn during a rebellion.
The Hunger Games: Mockingbird - Part 1, the third film in a franchise.
