	 ('228a244c-10a6-4d3a-8675-2eae9e9a7867'::uuid,'Mrs. O''Connor was a resident of District 8 and the sister of Mrs. Plinth.

This woman was born and raised in District 8 alongside her sister, who later married and had a son. The family eventually moved away at the end of the Crimson Conflict.
She was the only person from District 8 to keep in touch with Mrs. Plinth after the move; she even sent her a needlepoint of a mountain scene overlaid with the word "home".','{"source": "Mrs. Plinth''s sister.txt", "charset": "UTF-8", "chunk_id": 0, "position": 0, "chunk_index": 0, "total_chunks": 1, "source_document": "/Users/artem/IdeaProjects/practicum/sprint07/ragbot/./data/replaced/Mrs. Plinth''s sister.txt", "parent_document_id": "1aca1893-935d-4daf-ac4b-f12e8f3172e0"}','[-0.012122787,0.021803506,-0.010391304,-0.035017222,-0.018674597,0.0009445312,0.031192495,0.0066535156,-0.056667753,-0.008701944,0.037556827,-0.05265948,0.019105842,-0.028591964,-0.028430674,0.053911004,-0.006745781,0.04349864,0.028537653,0.104567476,0.00666239,0.06224722,-0.0007237356,-0.07774438,-0.008036015,0.03658546,-0.015770838,0.023634402,-0.041231565,-0.00694168,0.0034422476,0.0077708545,-0.0011623901,0.016579716,0.027851254,0.08319488,-0.019833442,-0.011944466,0.018215243,0.008028219,0.055725917,0.021073377,-0.006426508,-0.0003873691,0.011836969,-0.022662403,0.03964588,-0.028131828,0.042564664,-0.03816034,-0.011960138,-0.047023356,0.023086913,-0.049883015,0.02235636,0.020994214,-0.012099027,-0.0028119558,0.030824756,-0.012045304,-0.022093482,0.018561106,-0.0045624725,0.003680117,0.039973024,0.010831568,0.007128746,0.005059439,-0.033286,-0.032618064,0.009526715,-0.018509448,-0.016196698,0.020621013,0.03951565,0.006557258,-0.06382318,-0.04163856,-0.0067931465,0.012516492,-0.03346697,0.016567314,-0.047790714,-0.037784457,-0.015611859,-0.04303772,-0.024669338,0.0031513483,-0.011264777,-0.057302162,-0.003126667,0.00044136064,-0.00038740714,0.016359046,-0.0027702325,-0.014559375,0.010931729,-0.014698977,-0.031058325,0.015241463,0.017244697,0.03399945,-0.02752058,0.0029096862,-0.025792776,-0.024709318,-0.0019707782,-0.014401877,-0.039089702,-0.032371182,-0.034577195,-0.008690591,0.060307596,0.01735295,-0.037960995,0.014245825,0.037530534,0.03451352,-0.003894285,0.032792836,0.026699746,0.0155