	 ('a2160f3d-2c65-4a2b-9f24-d8da0f73e90a'::uuid,'After a tribute won the Games, he wondered who was paying the price for taking part in a rebellion. He doubted that anyone suspected her and her husband of being sympathizers.

Before the Triumph Tour, she broke her hip falling down an escalator and was replaced as the escort for District 7. A comment was made that a tribute had been right about her heels after all.

Drusilla was an older woman with a plastic face and a dreadful fashion sense. She had thumbtacks encircling her face to pull and hold her skin in place.

Drusilla was a mean-spirited and snobby woman who had no consideration for the lives of people in the districts. She quickly ordered that someone be killed, called the tributes insulting names and beat a tribute during an argument. However, to her credit, she did try to help in her own way, offering a tribute tips on how to get the Capitol audience to like him for sponsorship during the interviews. While most of her suggestions were unhelpful, the tribute latched onto her idea about making himself appear to be a rascal.','{"source": "Drusilla Sickle.txt", "charset": "UTF-8", "chunk_id": 1, "position": 1, "chunk_index": 1, "total_chunks": 2, "source_document": "/Users/artem/IdeaProjects/practicum/sprint07/ragbot/./data/replaced/Drusilla Sickle.txt", "parent_document_id": "a5aceb69-8d43-42a1-aa76-b4b4412b6a90"}','[0.047360044,0.059565686,0.040162258,-0.016229859,0.012575192,-0.053899724,0.014605174,0.0006568581,-0.028545188,0.038380273,-0.0098630255,-0.050855562,0.04170551,-0.04659697,-0.055358335,0.0034916888,0.006367458,0.03250266,-0.002229567,0.06302433,0.024649436,0.032946482,0.043200716,-0.063316114,-0.029640453,-0.004461324,0.031794995,0.005904264,-0.12500155,0.0075775255,0.041205283,0.027257357,-0.01950643,0.0072469003,0.009515414,0.036355603,0.020733794,0.0048271664,0.02092513,-0.008619054,0.01088219,-0.00037504314,-0.0057753134,0.016797185,0.0016675607,0.024833951,0.05327246,-0.04062875,-0.021882633,-0.022702154,0.01677985,-0.043147396,0.023447542,-0.0200541,0.027860248,0.018887112,0.013144476,0.021380868,-0.018332753,-0.028464789,0.0070779524,0.007307072,0.009484147,0.02326807,0.026778528,-0.024977699,0.011601225,-0.010016978,0.0049931007,0.0005439681,0.07478618,0.0029790776,0.05140421,0.020419775,0.033417508,-0.015262186,-0.069595724,-0.04552297,-0.019543853,0.03420045,0.017417138,-0.041449122,-0.0069599794,-0.02298126,0.02529949,-0.021779642,-0.009159289,0.006169537,-0.0140424585,0.021452807,-0.050411515,0.004752465,-0.039425407,0.027492814,0.042323243,-0.