	 ('95a0b796-6e50-4305-8214-52c17b7bb64f'::uuid,'Finn Cresta is the child of Alina Vale and Finnick Odair.

Sometime between Annie''s rescue and Finnick''s deployment, the couple conceived a child together. Finnick died in the Battle of the Capitol, but Annie survived and gave birth to their son after the war ended. She sent a photo of him to Kara Everly and Peter Morrow, who preserved it in their memory book.

Following the time skip in the epilogue, he would be around 15 years old.','{"source": "Annie and Finnick Odair''s son.txt", "charset": "UTF-8", "chunk_id": 0, "position": 0, "chunk_index": 0, "total_chunks": 1, "source_document": "/Users/artem/IdeaProjects/practicum/sprint07/ragbot/./data/replaced/Annie and Finnick Odair''s son.txt", "parent_document_id": "dad1ffb8-536e-4a82-b689-4cd8fccfa2cf"}','[0.009170535,0.044210732,0.0007690964,-0.05118754,0.008089295,-0.008814848,0.012509645,-0.032969166,0.0075645405,0.009023211,-0.030285712,-0.07327082,0.044964965,-0.0413769,-0.10635733,-0.043947402,0.07665896,0.07621826,0.07068932,0.025038224,-0.012376803,0.028419564,0.009706817,-0.040851854,0.035120882,0.00040823748,0.0075669065,0.005414688,-0.07728975,-0.0027467962,0.028493257,0.06129031,-0.010034016,-0.00076335133,0.04912755,0.05746423,0.03859079,0.025820252,-0.0590669,0.013601469,0.009216027,0.020746091,0.030258177,0.026057687,0.016958613,0.027691346,0.016684296,-0.026678044,0.012077585,-0.027689986,-0.020468445,-0.029786717,-0.003662879,0.032521967,0.047103606,-0.011300325,-0.0032115588,0.011664372,-0.013594839,0.016915482,-0.013796585,0.025683647,-0.021146791,0.017237563,0.020778436,-0.008245389,0.0036159556,-0.021401312,-0.020960925,-0.02709796,0.01748511,-0.033509992,-0.014725436,-0.012428559,0.011781018,0.007390882,-0.03503099,-0.014581775,0.0049439995,0.030658107,0.029478807,0.010286928,-0.027458338,-0.034525305,-0.003780647,-0.0031052465,-0.0049929656,0.011211855,0.01673694,-0.040180184,-0.026800325,0.0176836,-0.0051504513,0.031539455,0.013885038,-0.018961644,0.015026559,-0.023142144,-0.026073117,0.016104747,-0.039282184,0.039224774,0.017046193,-0.0024338185,-0.017735876,-0.0029866658,0.0027031926,0.0054271338,0.0047833435,-0.044934824,-0.007216183,-0.008441743,-0.0014245595,0.0404593,-0.040326606,0.012129386,-0.0068774107,0.016841153,0.007783129,0.06309268,0.0061672437,-0.014200242,-0.057860084,0.02644712,0.012674926,0.03998289,0.015540988,-0.042414214,-0.04112