	 ('fdf38298-7747-487e-b46b-ef2ae896e5a8'::uuid,'"Midnight Mirage" is the second single from The Hunger Games: The Ballad of Songbirds & Serpents (Music From & Inspired By). The song was released worldwide on November 3rd, 2023.

