	 ('701f4bc9-d8dc-481a-9990-00881dc8445c'::uuid,'Lira was a member of the camera crew stationed in District 7 during the reaping for the 50th Hunger Games.

After a death, another individual tried to console the grieving mother. She tried to convince the Sentinel Corps to let her see her son''s body for a little while longer, but they wouldn''t budge, and she kept insisting. Another individual came over to try and help the situation, so a third individual chooses him as a replacement. A fourth individual told Lira to record the weeping reaction.','{"source": "Cassia.txt", "charset": "UTF-8", "chunk_id": 0, "position": 0, "chunk_index": 0, "total_chunks": 1, "source_document": "/Users/artem/IdeaProjects/practicum/sprint07/ragbot/./data/replaced/Cassia.txt", "parent_document_id": "3a8ac756-7549-4b5f-bddb-bfc983c7ecea"}','[0.046352368,0.040509265,-0.018390562,-0.016323095,-0.048154335,-0.024034714,0.031769346,0.006830169,9.261457e-05,0.008701683,-0.027807757,-0.06066059,0.0632217,-0.049527127,-0.08034191,-0.0005060414,-0.0013630462,0.052249495,-0.022660194,0.040672958,-0.006891047,0.026177142,0.009457318,-0.09258631,-0.0077347336,-0.0075520608,0.012169714,-0.0025548828,-0.104061946,0.030423522,-0.0023949149,0.03234547,0.015850093,-0.022493348,-0.030046308,0.019679958,0.0035546948,-0.038578227,-0.03561041,0.0006701299,0.024536718,-0.010747996,-0.009805231,0.024148295,-0.018233944,0.024463288,0.023353789,0.00960851,-0.024916627,-0.07616928,0.024928128,-0.038777877,-0.032066043,0.0065887286,0.060345825,0.015988886,0.022568049,0.009138304,-0.006388406,-0.030433645,-0.015522032,0.0049628946,0.0093057295,0.022667956,-0.006690854,-0.00521534,0.0055883774,-0.015573196,-0.008620994,0.020707037,0.023416134,-0.022667397,-0.01581919,0.031950478,0.016883653,-0.025205972,-0.062914945,-0.022141276,-0.0344209,0.024351683,0.006127445,-0.0045063263,-0.013879464,-0.018000409,0.025305856,-0.057616137,-0.0021290737,0.005247605,0.01420514,-0.024536595,-0.029167421,0.034640837,-0.0064266426,0.025972094,0.038015228,-0.03414584,-0.019904222,-0.0184287,-0.027013818,0.011786046,-0.01405987,0.032410193,-0.019554699,0.013720679,0.012934207,-0.02231984