	 ('1229d278-57f1-4e3b-a3f4-39c1a1e8a691'::uuid,'She was highly efficient, a charismatic leader, and a remarkably subtle manipulator, having positioned every powerful player into the proper place to seize political victory. She was a noticeably less heavy-handed leader than her predecessor, and she was remarkably patient, waiting years before the right moment to seize power. While strict about enforcing the laws of Sector 13 and its strict daily regimens, she was able to give off the illusion of equality by providing all citizens with the essentials. However, Coin believed she had won the symbolic figure over to her side with a specific death, and she arrogantly underestimated their intelligence, assuming they would never figure out what she had done. She also overplayed her hand becoming interim president, which cast suspicion on her character and motives.

Coin and a key rebel often did not see eye to eye, owing to cultural differences. They argued over specifics, sometimes to the point of shouting. The rebel sometimes attempted to overstep boundaries, trying to maneuver Coin, but she swiftly, firmly, yet diplomatically shut him down. She did not tolerate having her authority undermined.','{"source": "Alma Coin.txt", "charset": "UTF-8", "chunk_id": 1, "position": 1, "chunk_index": 1, "total_chunks": 2, "source_document": "/Users/artem/IdeaProjects/practicum/sprint07/ragbot/./data/replaced/Alma Coin.txt", "parent_document_id": "2f3a7a2a-399c-487f-bacb-4dcac9486dc9"}','[-0.01571017,0.020646367,-0.0045646415,-0.00097381475,0.027429756,-0.08374951,0.01616742,0.00043634305,0.0047323564,-0.06993782,-0.053386156,-0.05679687,-0.004628408,-0.023244785,0.0021289308,0.025444867,0.030521668,0.023042066,-0.038995292,0.033468623,-0.008233411,0.04018194,0.018167803,-0.08599946,-0.042478323,0.0007071195,0.019882634,0.015325357,-0.09814269,0.040877942,0.03470678,0.014457208,-0.018504351,0.014036877,0.002501964,0.045102414,0.021203648,-0.01014691,0.0048959414,0.037570324,0.008184808,-0.011177236,0.005746572,0.05222663,0.025004046,-0.007561041,0.016525215,-0.03785838,-0.011060488,0.028353294,0.0007785595,-0.033814203,0.056422055,-0.006241115,0.047665503,-0.0045401882,0.018778581,0.018470744,0.024415597,-0.022355132,-0.04368554,0.023461256,0.012712847,0.026838627,0.016885139,-0.019362632,0.0008457033,-0.017589504,-0.0147088235,0.011899658,0.045228012,-0.017133206,0.004453518,0.0028403369,0.019728107,-0.05855825,-0.05016658,-0.019543195,0.008184133,0.021209437,0.0036385786,0.006946617,-0.028817449,-0.029604103,0.04938824,-0.006806854,-0.017132385,-0.009172922,-0.0047530383,-0.009962184,-0.05038899,0.07625251,-0.008953933,0.009851043,0.065228835,-0.029225217,-0.01721009,-0.011850156,-0.01592227,0.006141974,0.005849099,0.05017919,-0.01099923,0.014922908,-0.012385825,-0.0030327286,0.021300154,-0.034230836,0.015580482,-0.01022066,-0.023289653