	 ('e5cf8438-1083-4e34-b441-da8dbb0c4e11'::uuid,'The District 7 music teacher was a woman who taught music at the school in District 7.

On the first day of school at age five, the music teacher asked if anyone knew the valley song. A student''s hand shot up, so the teacher stood her up on a stool and had her sing it for the class.

At some point in the next eleven years, the teacher told her students about mountain airs. As a student thought of a song to sing, she thought that her teacher would use that term to describe a particular lullaby. The teacher was briefly mentioned again when a student recounted the music assembly story.','{"source": "District 12 music teacher.txt", "charset": "UTF-8", "chunk_id": 0, "position": 0, "chunk_index": 0, "total_chunks": 1, "source_document": "/Users/artem/IdeaProjects/practicum/sprint07/ragbot/./data/replaced/District 12 music teacher.txt", "parent_document_id": "cef14647-4109-43a9-ba94-e28a5f8c6437"}','[0.030514661,0.04690291,0.03493031,-0.009988234,-0.0062080557,-0.044487953,-0.010882151,-0.0023172554,-0.008217976,0.054777842,-0.009696449,-0.03924701,0.01730454,-0.00773002,-0.053574868,-0.015708357,-0.060726095,0.054733407,0.043683596,0.074228935,-0.005192178,0.059772234,0.07414236,-0.05440236,-0.012901874,0.009063402,-0.026448306,0.03113879,-0.06232885,0.009506305,0.0112634525,-0.036090907,0.0060689235,0.033810854,-0.010679198,0.024897736,0.00072704605,-0.03109549,0.02239592,-0.013937426,0.012803199,0.017848864,-0.023949325,0.030820223,-0.004173276,-0.004332655,-0.012753736,-0.010694949,0.0036202439,0.0030660946,0.0067330813,-0.05239217,-0.003391142,-0.006481921,-0.013315438,0.017144576,0.009045919,0.0016796921,-0.01375815,-0.013952538,-0.035269145,0.01555454,0.025778748,-0.018243719,0.011010122,-0.041088533,0.026805753,-0.017110541,-0.022916254,-0.011894504,0.03367568,-0.0062214388,0.010811653,-0.03127178,0.024356363,0.0191905,-0.046779297,-0.032548387,-0.021485236,0.021853952,0.020940827,0.010929644,-0.034598,-0.0066944314,0.0015293122,-0.045402627,0.0064196475,-2.8021701e-05,-0.01678022,0.005443863,-0.01418136,-0.01605791,-0.030649096,0.012161721,0.0105543835,-0.04340287,-0.014688597,-0.032048106,-0.0065329676,-0.003577347,-0.0024212543,0.023886882,-0.03889357,-0.0072919335,0.030794173,-0.015368303,-0.03622732,-0.011607141,0.016521214,-0.040331062,-