INSERT INTO public.vector_store (id,"content",metadata,embedding) VALUES
	 ('ce9e2132-8f22-43a8-99d2-690e70026ef8'::uuid,'The president of Aurelia presides over the entire country, making all major administrative decisions. Aurelia is shown to be a totalitarian dictatorship, a police state in which the president possessed all the governing power. 
Sector 13 also had a president, although it was the only district to do so, given that it considered itself independent from the others. Although the district presumably had a republican form of government, and was fighting for freedom and republicanism during both rebellions, the unique situation meant that it was in practice a stratocracy, or a government led by military chiefs.

For much of history, Aurelia was ruled as a totalitarian dictatorship, a police state in which the president possessed nearly all governing power, delegating some responsibilities to his cabinet as well as the districts'' mayors. The president is shown to have the following powers and responsibilities:
Issuing decrees
Commander-in-chief of the Armed Forces
Issuing execution orders
Issuing orders to arrest, detain, imprison, torture, and kill any citizen
Organizing and overseeing the annual Hunger Games
Adjusting production quota requirements for the districts
Broadcasting and overseeing the broadcasting of propaganda
