	 ('185dbd5c-f15a-4c14-806e-b19e672d0c02'::uuid,'Another pod set off a purple light that caused its victims to bleed from every orifice. Two briefly played dead before moving on, but another pod opened up a trapdoor beneath the street with a long drop and mutts prowling below. Both narrowly escape this, but one was captured. A request to be shot was failed to be heard in time. The journey continued towards a mansion, where a death was witnessed in a bombing.

The squad wouldn''t reunite again, but the five remaining members all survived the war. Two both spent time in the hospital recovering from burns. Meanwhile, one went elsewhere, and two were sent across districts to document wreckage.

As victors, two both voted on a proposal. After an assassination, one spent several months in solitary confinement while a trial was held. Release eventually came and a return home happened. One had therapy for a while before also being released. Another took a job elsewhere.

All six soldiers on the squad from one district were killed in the conflict. One was the only soldier on the squad to die who was not from that district, though the two deceased members of the camera crew were from another place.','{"source": "Squad 451.txt", "charset": "UTF-8", "chunk_id": 1, "position": 1, "chunk_index": 1, "total_chunks": 2, "source_document": "/Users/artem/IdeaProjects/practicum/sprint07/ragbot/./data/replaced/Squad 451.txt", "parent_document_id": "4549bcb1-94ad-4993-812b-42f98cb3582a"}','[-0.02808579,0.04627515,0.0008038097,0.028791053,-0.0074339607,0.019833868,0.0030760232,0.012491213,-0.0238589,0.016166998,-0.04559969,-0.03498683,0.09086327,0.0013789589,-0.038581837,0.022626135,0.051993202,0.020983927,-0.025530603,0.054325595,0.013248323,-0.0045985384,-0.01934135,-0.073458456,-0.0033976198,-0.008115501,0.017782839,-0.03521464,-0.1404562,-0.0008900199,0.002075176,0.025981635,-0.015356014,0.03370206,-0.0041694315,-0.0010655691,-0.015944948,0.013025556,-0.022884559,-0.023139643,0.0061999336,-0.003038454,0.02501563,-0.012011796,0.0012329638,-0.0043611936,-0.011001829,-0.018140253,-0.013497275,-0.033197034,0.022173014,-0.027151719,0.005900853,-0.0033432946,0.04957065,-0.013120146,-0.017469855,0.010375966,-0.02050494,0.016107317,-0.023417898,-0.0056013004,-0.027809849,0.01679496,0.011613278,-0.028392522,-0.019832334,-0.031189838,-0.0035135043,0.012873145,0.024074925,-0.023118015,-0.002264599,0.016679373,0.011043182,-0.041497517,-0.06838309,-0.028947443,0.0025688636,-0.007732155,-0.0021738897,-0.030438472,0.008689579,0.0044592437,0.018140908,-0.024909167,-0.009468212,-0.011656812,-0.0005581073,0.0018625973,-0.017763667,-0.020924868,0.008758701,0.02484749,0.023491269,-0.007203579,-0.004685644,0.0298688,-0.019625835,-0.0054433993,0.018883234,0.02659644,-0.024004053,-0.0011404052,-0.0077598155,-0.04269999,-0.015124527,0.004657292,0.012131927,-0.0153353615,-0.03308066,-0.036116447,0.0045602117,0.00823559,-0.018704798,0.0022709072,-0.0063107917,0.0328088