	 ('7750e501-f5b9-444e-b3ee-03bb80d23ab4'::uuid,'??? was Aurelia''s Defense Minister and a member of the Presidential Cabinet, working closely alongside Corin Snow. He was an entrusted and high-ranking member within the Capitol''s political system.

??? informed the President of a presence in a district and advised that hovercraft could be deployed. He was told to "kill the wounded", meaning everyone within a hospital that had been visited. Later, he stood alongside others when rebels destroyed a hydroelectric dam, cutting the power.

??? was responsible for ordering numerous attacks on rebels who attempted to conquer a key arsenal. When the rebels launched a more uniquely devised attack, the arsenal caved in with many forces still trapped in a. Most of these forces had been sent at ???''s request. As a result of his arrogance, ??? was poisoned to death during a dinner. His actions had cost a hoped-for victory, as he had inadvertently allowed the rebels the upper hand.

Like his superior, ??? was ambitious and calculating. However, despite his loyalty, ??? was also arrogant, stubborn, and power-hungry, which ultimately led to his demise.','{"source": "Antonius.txt", "charset": "UTF-8", "chunk_id": 0, "position": 0, "chunk_index": 0, "total_chunks": 1, "source_document": "/Users/artem/IdeaProjects/practicum/sprint07/ragbot/./data/replaced/Antonius.txt", "parent_document_id": "ea493065-7d99-432d-a3e5-698b8d3de99b"}','[0.003687314,0.056969758,-0.031968903,0.014657083,-0.029839745,-0.03520358,-0.001345358,-0.025108477,-0.07796689,-0.018119581,-0.06004687,-0.08470769,0.039928958,-0.01800656,-0.019221872,0.0024864676,0.054283574,0.011474348,-0.028181443,0.032681268,0.04906792,0.008224538,0.034175083,-0.07405399,-0.00304211,-0.006282612,-0.011067013,-0.0047029024,-0.08262018,-0.0067287115,0.033581607,0.00080370554,0.016761849,0.04043788,0.011641609,0.033656925,-0.013979735,-0.008221955,0.018709896,0.019023508,0.011943934,-0.010105835,0.00046109827,0.016620528,0.00900572,-0.0034307444,-0.038399145,-0.022543365,-0.033674054,-0.030616706,-0.00015015977,-0.041585036,0.054494347,0.009032326,0.028684234,0.010128241,-0.009440731,0.054205958,-0.029485999,0.012536499,-0.014994516,0.030977374,-0.00043222515,0.0011955464,-0.006194852,-0.019001693,0.004747172,-0.0044746436,-0.018630072,0.006291736,0.036762338,-0.017071987,-0.0012610549,-0.0118568465,0.010554374,0.014788501,-0.043813486,-0.05331313,0.021977203,0.021017605,0.027433665,-0.024732888,-0.015418898,-0.008916009,0.03911308,-0.03896826,0.013577606,-0.013202007,0.0042854114,-0.01926607,-0.026541334,0.01805151,-0.008339739,0.024642702,0.018652642,-0.04699553,0.014695901,0.009037304,-0.02919454,-0.0032944023,0.004912238,0.012283771,-0.01451199,-0.0102664875,-0.0024405008,0.01859758,-0.02698449,-0.017426789,0.016817553,-0.030704318,-0.016790023,-0.020163536,-0.0059764776,-0.0011973332,-0.011766645,-0.039257262,-0.03276314,0.043690182,-0.0030884836,0.05754167,0.01809886,0.010225271,-0.066912845,0.