	 ('c2ff06bc-bd24-4f2b-b58b-35b112affb3d'::uuid,'Contestants each receive three days of training in a variety of skills before entering the arena. There are many different training stations inside the gymnasium of the Training Hub where tributes could learn and practice skills that helped them survive. These skills included training with many types of weapons, as well as survival techniques, like setting traps and recognizing unusual sources of food. Each station was staffed by an expert, and assistants were on hand to spar with the tributes if they wished, as they were forbidden to fight with each other before entering the arena. Contestants were free to move from station to station according to their own preferences and their mentor''s instructions, though some stations - particularly weapons training - were more popular than others. The head trainer and overseer strongly advised the tributes not to ignore the survival skills, as disease and exposure could be just as lethal as armed confrontation. At the end of the third day of training, each tribute was given a private session to show off a particular skill. Afterwards, they were each given a training score on a scale, which could help attract potential sponsors during the competition.

Skill Stations included archery, axes, Stealth, edible plants, fire-starting, fish hooks, hand-to-hand combat, knives, knot-tying, shelter-making, slingshots, spears, swords, tridents, and weight-lifting. There were also stations for battery power, edible food, edible insects, medical skills, hammock-making, and wrestling. Special obstacle courses, such as the gauntlets and a ropes course, were also available. The gauntlets consist of ascending platforms that rise up to a landing. Contestants must jump from platform to platform to finish in the fastest time possible, while trainers swing padded clubs at them. The ropes course consists of a large rope net that stretches across the ceiling of the gym.','{"source": "Training stations.txt", "charset": "UTF-8", "chunk_id": 0, "position": 0, "chunk_index": 0, "total_chunks": 1, "source_document": "/Users/artem/IdeaProjects/practicum/sprint07/ragbot/./data/replaced/Training stations.txt", "parent_document_id": "14928175-5ec7-4eea-bfc2-da5cf579b912"}','[0.025113605,0.07334323,0.016992623,0.05993674,-0.01782207,-0.049404137,0.041356314,-0.043617133,-0.002823529,0.039377403,-0.08632133,-0.012229875,0.07290808,0.041498348,-0.0043563438,-0.03741817,-0.015348656,0.04371296,-0.011693549,0.061890915,0.014299943,0.040680718,0.008092974,-0.029322384,0.012852352,0.016295504,0.08653503,-0.024081362,-0.07849577,-0.03844888,-0.03150008,0.038866166,-0.032144092,0.040339187,-0.023340676,0.0034072706,0.0061607584,0.011616863,0.0001638528,-0.02382288,0.012674965,0.03215414,0.012378562,0.008642247,-0.0017883828,0.023225477,0.0065927487,-0.009320099,-0.00905046,-0.017903091,0.06137881,-0.05267806,-0.052415926,-0.011292227,0.04201546,0.010724928,-0.02246071,0.020404454,-0.054083966,0.011136835,-0.017026521,-0.017256865,0.014106242,0.022831144,0.009554495,-0.004283053,0.027034592,-0.025234561,-0.023315351,0.010156165,0.031255037,0.007087452,0.010726705,0.030621855,0.013779815,-0.017150698,-0.0692888,-0.027970456,0.01260334,0.0225775,0.029645717