	 ('b7cd4cd6-56d2-4c60-81bc-b1498f7e6f2a'::uuid,'Mr. Whitaker lived in the Seam with his three children and wife. He did not live to see the birth of his daughter. His wife gave birth to her just after he died. He worked as a coal miner.

Mr. Whitaker died in a tragic mine accident. The event took place five years before the Flame Games.

