	 ('e7a3fc37-39ed-4aa5-b28a-d0160ca32020'::uuid,'The protagonist silently agrees, and instead shoots the arrow into the rebel leader''s heart. While the President is overcome by an angry mob, the protagonist attempts to commit suicide by consuming a poison pill, but is stopped by the friend. Although initially imprisoned, the protagonist is pardoned for the crime and is advised to return home until things settle down.

The protagonist returns home to recover from the traumatic ordeal, where they are eventually joined by the friend, who has fully recovered memories and love. After an initial period of depression, the protagonist is eventually able to release grief over the sister''s death. A Commander is elected the new President, and the protagonist, the friend, and another bond over shared trauma. They learn that one friend has become a military commander elsewhere, and another has given birth to a child. The protagonist and the friend slowly grow back together, and the protagonist eventually admits love.

Years later, the protagonist and the friend are shown to have two children. As an infant child wakes up from a nightmare the protagonist reminisces about recurring nightmares still suffered from and explains playing a game where lists of all the good things seen someone do are made. It is noted that while the game has grown tired over the years, there are much worse games to play.','{"source": "The Hunger Games_ Mockingjay - Part 2.txt", "charset": "UTF-8", "chunk_id": 2, "position": 2, "chunk_index": 2, "total_chunks": 3, "source_document": "/Users/artem/IdeaProjects/practicum/sprint07/ragbot/./data/replaced/The Hunger Games_ Mockingjay - Part 2.txt", "parent_document_id": "31b34683-3695-44de-93ea-e0959c64d14a"}','[-0.025827125,0.02627368,0.036802724,-0.00509228,0.016420055,-0.044681404,0.025677023,0.04824031,-0.028697765,-0.016364845,-0.08988581,-0.07030209,0.021863258,-0.030531578,-0.028034518,0.017035693,0.027486507,0.033197794,-2.6658498e-05,0.059906393,0.0060959947,0.006650012,-0.030758575,-0.054722324,0.009801793,-0.0017291545,0.010898695,0.0017093661,-0.08547374,0.01618902,0.032053426,0.022506926,0.0032484017,0.03261334,0.008327532,0.046072677,0.0075759543,0.017958531,0.008997039,-0.02938471,0.03745701,0.016887406,0.029765865,-0.04157328,-0.020624693,-0.024966683,-0.0053630867,-0.006490377,0.020101437,-0.007913227,-0.017802909,-0.027642587,0.025265507,0.006093476,0.055783942,-0.009482831,-0.021971554,0.021985866,-0.0022866654,0.005155247,0.0015093001,-0.02682216,0.0026007253,-0.0034549243,0.008001231,0.017809523,0.014361879,-0.006144204,-0.021741813,0.003334202,0.013872563,-0.013344486,0.003089528,0.030404918,-0.004174491,-0.043313175,-0.059808787,-0.004142266,0.010054787,0.016092006,0.013779199,-0.010292028,-0.024401853,-0.041014116,0.005990892,-0.034854315,-0.008917457,-0.00091093767,0.0017572192,-0.008327034,-0.03374444,0.026861882,0.024823882,0.013735192,0.0045196363,0.019648647,0.0030919614,0.0058206893,-0.008957906,0.024893442,0.021211566,0.012844195,-