	 ('78f40dd0-a531-45d3-9d01-b55edfd72dee'::uuid,'Elm Street was a street in the Capitol where the Academy was located.

Elm Street was a narrower street than another major thoroughfare. It could easily hold a large honor guard marching in flawless uniformity. The street was used for funeral processions, which could include vehicles and marching formations. It could be used to get to the Academy and another major building. There was also a park and a bakery along the way.','{"source": "Scholars Road.txt", "charset": "UTF-8", "chunk_id": 0, "position": 0, "chunk_index": 0, "total_chunks": 1, "source_document": "/Users/artem/IdeaProjects/practicum/sprint07/ragbot/./data/replaced/Scholars Road.txt", "parent_document_id": "74a19999-56c0-4d1f-80d3-6d441f4a30c0"}','[-0.0071151624,0.049780414,-0.0072312322,0.027935369,-0.059534755,0.03190756,-0.0037633367,0.031114431,0.004558025,0.024882115,-0.022138992,-0.012579337,0.046293728,-0.009730244,0.0356214,-0.012610827,0.002564493,0.10506158,-0.021998908,0.11098943,-0.00619164,0.02169902,0.015013304,-0.055661626,0.008727209,-0.0059711696,-0.046877954,0.04251744,-0.03813566,0.010793063,0.0340639,0.004612303,-0.0155997975,0.02859405,-0.0021754545,0.034868967,-0.006785729,-0.013425288,-0.0011541421,-0.04758476,0.02913775,0.02021419,-0.0038982234,0.0029955364,-0.010258668,0.00081147114,0.0026862826,-0.026444424,-0.007193855,0.006328432,0.00046936594,-0.06589877,-0.01932242,0.0006242041,-0.004130439,-0.001945376,-0.033068232,-0.0019992986,0.013768154,-0.04336512,-0.037530363,0.022970797,0.004599274,-0.004087475,-0.008722053,-0.0135889305,-0.022304142,0.0063288985,-0.008931189,0.032477852,-0.00031875906,0.008087668,0.0053767273,-0.030450707,-0.0036507137,0.012347266,-0.043873418,-0.026238782,0.012694184,0.01296443,0.01849359,-0.008182095,-0.036358397,-0.023700213,0.036493365,0.00085216237,0.014752441,-0.013191458,-0.027483635,-0.01719815,-0.011793452,0.0075890236,0.0042768954,0.040307533,-0.014440791,0.031916488,-0.009122268,-0.011599494,-0.023393026,0.052241154,-0.0011340516,0.03115723,-0.021198357,-0.021572115,0.03833365,-0.01675371,-0.032287218,0.031