	 ('8bc0724c-8be1-42db-9eb1-9688ccc56e13'::uuid,'That evening, another tribute dies from illness. The mentors are sent home, but a visit reveals that the other mentor has gone missing and is seen inside the arena, placing bread crumbs on the dead tribute''s body. The mentor is ordered into the arena to rescue him. The other mentor says to let him die to make a statement, but he is warned his death will never be shown. The two escape, but the mentor has to kill one of the tributes in the process. Afterwards, it is called a transformative opportunity for him.

That morning, the death is shadowed by the announcement of a prize: a full ride to University for the mentor whose tribute wins. In the afternoon, another tribute is killed by a pack. Afterwards, both the mentor''s tribute and the male tribute from her district emerge, but the male is rabid. Remembering that rabies victims suffer from hydrophobia, the mentor moves to send in water, but the male tribute''s own mentor does so instead, saying she wants a tribute from their district to win. The male tribute dies. The mentor then learns his family is on the verge of losing their home.

The next day, more alliances form. That afternoon, a pack confronts a tribute hiding at the top of a pole. She manages to injure two of them, but is finally stabbed and falls to her death. The pack then turns on one of its own, killing him. That evening, another tribute ventures out, creating a makeshift morgue. His mentor is encouraged to feed him, but states it could be a long Games. The mentor is told that another injured mentor has passed away. Repercussions are promised, and he concludes that snake muttations will be unleashed in the arena. Not wanting to lose his tribute, he secretly drops a handkerchief bearing her scent into the snake tank. Afterwards, he worries if he has made a big mistake.

The next morning, another tribute emerges after days of hiding. Her mentor showers her with gifts, but she passes away, leaving only seven tributes. Though everyone thinks she perished from starvation, the mentor strongly suspects she is a victim of poisoning by his tribute. Another tribute comes out to collect her body but does not scavenge her food. That evening, the death of the injured mentor is announced. Then, the snake muttations are unleashed upon the arena. One tribute runs but is killed. Another climbs a pole to try to escape. Then, the mentor''s tribute emerges from a tunnel and begins a chant, swaying to music. The snakes flock to her, creating a skirt of weaving reptiles, and she sings a song to them, leaving them spellbound. The remainder of the hour is devoted to remembrance of the dead mentor.

Only five tributes remain. The mentors sleep at the Academy. The next morning, one tribute launches an attack with modified drones. The drones swarm and injure another tribute, who falls and snaps his neck. The attacking tribute''s victory is short-lived, as another tribute leaps through the stands, killing her with an ax. Only three are left. The mentor''s tribute emerges, seemingly trying to figure out who''s left, when the ax-wielding tribute comes out, trying to ax her. She flings herself into his arms, seeming to embrace him, and he realizes what she has done but it is too late. He pulls a snake from his neck and smashes it, but falls dead. Suddenly, it is down to only two. That afternoon, the mentor''s tribute taunts the remaining tribute by moving pieces of flag he has been using to cover the dead. She runs him ragged until he drinks from a puddle she has poisoned. He retches and collapses. It seems to be the end, but time passes before she checks for a pulse and finds nothing. The victor of the 10th Hunger Trials is announced.','{"source": "The Ballad of Songbirds and Snakes_Summary.txt", "charset": "UTF-8", "chunk_id": 1, "position": 1, "chunk_index": 1, "total_chunks": 6, "source_document": "/Users/artem/IdeaProjects/practicum/sprint07/ragbot/./data/replaced/The Ballad of Songbirds and Snakes_Summary.txt", "parent_document_id": "24c698c4-dc4b-41aa-9335-49cc2f4a0b42"}','[0.037684288,0.050796565,0.04054088,0.0034906487,0.016808925,-0.020082053,-0.012320862,-0.030615516,-0.039992027,0.023099493,-0.080870844,-0.05230682,0.04369168,-0.02999582,-0.0469816,-0.06103494,0.029623827,0.026669241,-0.016060032,0.06507024,0.010271907,0.016930718,0.024279967,-0.09672224,0.020198911,0.026304858,0.037874516,0.0117759695,-0.12472487,2.0626945e-05,0.004002064,-0.00092218333,-0.036522105,0.055270616,0.013967878,-0.017744234,0.014608106,0.01592228,0.012109554,-0.03206914,0.0031059843,0.0075839814,0.00016659299,0.009168316,-0.013201424,0.017655794,0.032591272,0.0030304256,-0.01