	 ('828bbadb-cbd9-4605-b13e-73bc3c40d1c6'::uuid,'As mockingjays pick up the song, he fires all around the woods, but cannot tell if he has hit her.

As it storms, he goes back to the lake and begins a desperate flight back to the base. He makes it back, where his story of a snake bite is not questioned. He asks if he''s going to die, but is told the snake wasn''t venomous and the bite will only leave a scar. The next day, he boards a hovercraft. Before they arrive at their destination, however, the craft stops in the Capitol. His destination is the Citadel, where he is met by the high official. She tells him she''s pleased he continued his studies, asking what more he had learned about chaos and control. He tells her he''s learned','{"source": "The Ballad of Songbirds and Snakes_Summary.txt", "charset": "UTF-8", "chunk_id": 5, "position": 5, "chunk_index": 5, "total_chunks": 6, "source_document": "/Users/artem/IdeaProjects/practicum/sprint07/ragbot/./data/replaced/The Ballad of Songbirds and Snakes_Summary.txt", "parent_document_id": "24c698c4-dc4b-41aa-9335-49cc2f4a0b42"}','[0.019388309,0.013818431,0.0413996,-0.009050911,-0.03020757,-0.055657554,-0.025827771,0.007173715,-0.03235362,-0.016197817,-0.05746501,-0.073698945,0.047253996,-0.020594414,0.010634961,0.014829472,0.04623736,0.014682702,0.024610288,0.09259543,-0.010542568,0.009644017,-0.03399171,-0.076678626,0.029035576,0.027026003,0.04446755,-0.033117875,-0.112253636,0.003497323,0.025411377,0.017567642,0.0075673093,0.03997986,-0.007037586,0.0440473,0.0030111782,-0.014034206,0.018641481,-0.010753649,-0.008030722,0.04694575,0.041763104,0.021982046,0.0007788384,-0.02170679,-0.023089709,0.0006991296,-0.024937397,-0.03963394,0.025481978,-0.055340555,0.006039666,0.02433715,0.0077746175,0.016527362,-0.002277803,0.039789688,-0.036663428,0.010538383,-0.002324266,-0.013332841,-0.016916217,0.0062632533,-0.009373606,-0.027075738,0.017900344,-0.02319367,0.033036392,-0.016517041,0.016227897,-0.026908673,0.025145492,0.018839132,0.012341912,-0.00034533057,-0.076354705,-0.025459314,-0.022736898,0.03235412,0.017403413,-0.032599904,-0.047092143,-0.020597799,0.061063003,-0.021