	 ('3239c2e4-386b-4851-b649-ed7ff607ee13'::uuid,'Transportation technology includes a high-speed train system that can cover great distances in less than 24 hours. Hovercrafts are a means of aerial transport for military use, passengers, or cargo. Sponsor gifts were delivered via drone, using facial recognition to lock onto targets. These drones were later replaced with silver parachutes.

Weaponry technology includes drones that could be hacked. At the beginning of each game, participants emerge into the arena on metal plates wired to landmines. If a participant attempts to leave their plate before a countdown is complete, the mines detonate. Landmines could be re‑positioned and reactivated to create a protective obstacle. A gun converted solar energy into rays of power, giving the weapon potentially unlimited ammunition. Wire could be used to create an electrical trap. Training stations featured mobile, holographic targets shaped like humans, some wielding virtual weapons. Nuclear technology is used to make bombs, explosives, and missiles. A custom‑made, military grade bow and arrows fired razor‑sharp, incendiary, and explosive projectiles, and allowed for accurate hits from one hundred yards away. The bow could be deactivated and reactivated by voice command. Obstacles are used to stop advancing forces.','{"source": "Technology.txt", "charset": "UTF-8", "chunk_id": 1, "position": 1, "chunk_index": 1, "total_chunks": 2, "source_document": "/Users/artem/IdeaProjects/practicum/sprint07/ragbot/./data/replaced/Technology.txt", "parent_document_id": "02edef80-dae0-4f37-bda1-262241a4caa5"}','[0.024514494,0.033982676,0.012537737,0.05186274,0.008088469,-0.007225954,-0.014898978,-0.030155249,-0.051411718,0.042587735,-0.056810006,-0.02065013,0.08620915,0.01573533,0.06673196,-0.031813674,0.030833678,0.030954286,-0.008776186,0.02384591,-0.018456016,-0.021989431,0.010475438,-0.040561415,-0.013471501,0.04985395,0.06765321,-0.096701436,-0.07917515,-0.07186011,-0.0613588,-0.0092232935,-0.0031694195,0.06622066,-0.045297418,-0.01114052,-0.0016060431,-0.0003174432,0.00561742,-0.027589409,0.012634217,0.01388742,0.021545786,0.0025375027,-0.014001466,-0.0038606965,0.027242864,-0.017403862,-0.02698594,-0.0017443392,0.06184156,-0.056365505,-0.030679831,-0.010894793,0.013249359,-0.0035233758,-0.032098074,0.01844646,-0.04765269,0.00043618362,-0.027107054,-0.011063188,-0.0149