	 ('e7af4332-5e87-4cb1-bcd4-678152a34be8'::uuid,'While walking north, she discovered a plant and excitedly buried her face in them to smell as they reminded her of home. However, like most things in the arena, they were poisoned. She began choking while the ally tried to console her, until blood poured out of her eyes, nose and mouth. She then started convulsing and recognizing she was in tremendous pain, the ally begged the Gamemakers to pump a lethal dose of drugs into her using the pump they implanted to put her out of her misery. They did not oblige so the ally pulled the device and ended her life himself. He then whispered to the Gamemakers into the device in her ear that they did this to her and called them murderers.

When the hovercraft arrived to collect her body, the ally refused to hand her over without a fight. To force him, the Gamemakers sent deadly muttations after him. When they stung him, he dropped her in a jolt of pain and her body was retrieved. It is unknown what was done with her body.

She looks exactly like the original tribute, same size, height, heart shaped face, big gray eyes and long dark hair in braids. The Capitol likely altered parts of her appearance so she''d be a passable body double. However, her body was bony and her face had been noticeably plumped to make it look fuller.','{"source": "Lou Lou.txt", "charset": "UTF-8", "chunk_id": 1, "position": 1, "chunk_index": 1, "total_chunks": 2, "source_document": "/Users/artem/IdeaProjects/practicum/sprint07/ragbot/./data/replaced/Lou Lou.txt", "parent_document_id": "10c260a7-7625-49d3-bccc-230108e12496"}','[0.039318223,0.08467776,0.067314625,-0.0075588753,0.0073176827,-0.02895296,0.0073627015,-0.03470105,-0.045077115,0.012752239,-0.04995883,-0.04201181,0.028121864,-0.04001365,-0.027763829,0.008608793,0.058191456,0.037234057,-0.0029974424,0.050214216,0.01808631,-0.012641697,-0.0032778783,-0.092289105,0.019051954,0.043741155,-0.022223765,-0.012757729,-0.08806942,-0.02882865,0.011575689,0.05789936,0.0016067405,0.01244811,-0.0040059993,0.028983383,0.013955697,0.034676712,0.029610693,-0.032396562,0.024659283,0.00088341505,0.008895662,0.030075345,0.030139374,-0.021522002,0.027229719,-0.04739393,-1.6582379e-05,-0.021710835,0.010574142,-0.03732061,0.039658327,0.019434256,0.059932683,0.024281388,-0.0062664654,0.029470831,-0.034355678,0.0057107285,-0.012874045,0.0093904855,0.0022378706,0.03315831,-0.005703618,-0.04463311,-0.007822444,-0.014955447,0.014045437,0.035056654,0.057009235,-0.01471408,0.024210755,0.0008866654,0.0033971467,-0.031626772,-0.06360762,-0.06550727,0.0057542697,0.029411083,0.012252624,-0.01726035,-0.023043614,-0.032290634,0.032187063,-0.033557076,-0.0107430685,0.011132293,0.007870839,0.0072918544,-0.031704456,0.009704958,-0.018677015,0.010150922,0.01842543,-0.04653079,0.013683304,0.0011348397,-0.03902179,-0.009464486,0.009888328,0.051304284,0.017863492,-0.00068851496,0.002218626,0.020091979,0.008016875,-0.023210559,0.016663542,-0.030578341,-0.047049355,-0.00049486104,-0.01265162,0.0