	 ('aec555ec-774f-4e34-8dac-b9525ee4e015'::uuid,'The Mira (District 9 tribute) was the female tribute from District 9 who participated in the 70th Hunger Games.

In the film, she is first seen in the Tribute Parade with her District Ally, wearing a silver studded outfit and a silver half-circle behind her, and waving to the crowd.

The Mira (District 9 tribute) was killed in the initial Golden Horn bloodbath. Her pedestal was the farthest to the left.

In the film, she was 14 years old. In the arena, she wore a bottle green jacket. She is seen in the sky when the fallen images are shown. Her face was also the last one seen on day one.','{"source": "District 9 Female (74th HG).txt", "charset": "UTF-8", "chunk_id": 0, "position": 0, "chunk_index": 0, "total_chunks": 1, "source_document": "/Users/artem/IdeaProjects/practicum/sprint07/ragbot/./data/replaced/District 9 Female (74th HG).txt", "parent_document_id": "1cb81355-a488-4145-980e-316001769e15"}','[0.043719947,0.05979959,-0.012582111,0.002325291,-0.014827706,-0.022929838,0.049981847,-0.013661947,-0.041895967,0.046956353,0.0073868404,-0.062397268,0.06381411,-0.049361303,-0.0019282167,-0.024446126,-0.0385498,0.03157217,-0.011370898,0.07001556,-0.019059964,0.011204526,0.001577834,-0.06534442,-0.020372964,0.014825656,-0.009085022,-0.012167402,-0.100543976,-0.023739798,-0.0033855063,0.041171737,0.022438714,0.0070979996,-0.015438148,-0.024743732,0.011571601,-0.0012112766,-0.03139482,-0.044433225,-0.0003654741,-0.01011564,-0.013782768,0.012086827,-0.008494245,0.013209603,0.046279658,-0.0023647456,-0.029398331,-0.01637377,0.035730433,-0.03923518,-0.014836708,0.020089064,0.058311164,-0.0066392724,-0.007300999,0.017625004,-0.040862888,-0.041709147,-0.020039663,0.007613363,0.020231785,0.030804478,-0.018151501,-0.0578078,-0.020205462,0.0051088273,0.0010920813,0.0070800325,0.026573107,0.0016174455,0.013665433,0.0017031655,0.0033656165,-0.027928304,-0.044286694,-0.046180908,-0.035498347,0.013863606,-0.008716967,0.002304949,-0.036902517,-0.0025713725,0.02502054,-0.05190795,-0.025139885,-0.0016116073,-0.015278043,-0.007177035,-0.009112689,0.02044667,-0.0388486,0.022824809,0.032773893,-0.027334865,0.01350437,0.02175063,-0.020179395,0.033217516,0.005597801,0.037847877,-0.051457755,-0.018092506,0.0027139273,-0.00875397,-0.00658267,-0.05093254,0.045912202,-0.016364051,-0.03909749,0.0061279247,0.016224585,0.04087464,-0.022171227,0.010503102,0.014168935,0.022569368,0.033357307,0.0378