	 ('8de0f66f-1ed7-4aef-be5f-0469bb25df9a'::uuid,'This unnamed Jace was the victor of the 74th Hunger Trials.

He was a Career Tribute, likely having trained and volunteered to participate. His age was 16 during the Games. His weapon was a brick.

During the Games, he made it to the final two. He overpowered his final opponent, disarmed him, and used a brick from nearby rubble to beat him to death, securing his victory.

He was later spared from competing in a subsequent Hunger Trials. His fate is presumed deceased, most likely killed during a purge of victors.

In a film depiction, his arena wear included a red jacket. He was the last Career to become a victor under normal circumstances.','{"source": "District 2 Male (73rd HG).txt", "charset": "UTF-8", "chunk_id": 0, "position": 0, "chunk_index": 0, "total_chunks": 1, "source_document": "/Users/artem/IdeaProjects/practicum/sprint07/ragbot/./data/replaced/District 2 Male (73rd HG).txt", "parent_document_id": "98eb4cb5-188d-414d-9665-7b1eff68d53c"}','[0.046892263,0.08002246,0.09067935,-0.0039327038,-0.020001205,-0.048212197,0.029993864,-0.008280075,-0.018474985,-0.0027313498,-0.036165323,-0.06765603,0.03377658,-0.017012797,-0.023042234,-0.051098824,0.050048444,-0.010705872,0.012393846,0.023858659,-0.014568584,-0.0030485836,0.025506247,-0.04932394,0.05418847,0.01727234,0.011257153,-0.01626387,-0.10486928,-0.008637553,0.06006712,-0.027753612,0.035143726,0.028373577,0.004347744,-0.006508866,-0.014377769,-0.04148181,-0.013035753,0.011530358,-0.029110035,0.017132698,0.05869159,-0.023552727,0.020763766,0.044865,-0.0032785495,0.01786131,-0.016495712,-0.0033299157,0.022872701,-0.04521846,0.02790064,0.062122945,0.00065880775,-0.018827137,-0.013958549,0.03206118,0.0018714577,0.030822072,-0.031228863,0.017841298,0.0063254256,0.030987563,0.013984763,0.005722238,-0.012867549,-0.031634253,-0.018088657,0.007945026,0.015744163,0.019501505,0.01713279,0.0065467884,0.019393722,-0.04468718,-0.0568919,-0.034605708,-0.011257204,0.031290345,0.03005886,-0.0068638744,-0.026760409,-0.02172119,0.029789397,-0.015185877,-0.018663302,0.017929358,-0.0034694094,0.013786209,0.0035626753,0.00083036267,-0.02657074,0.006195931,-0.009807783,0.016435007,-0.012208933,0.019869093,-0.034640063,0.039038602,-0.018172536,0.05286701,0.016529888,0.004860765,-0.016193485,-0.0054998514,0.015176336,-0.023342699,0.023633936,-0.03602211,-0.037536267,0.006386201,-0.0058333003,-0.0076402584,0.0033493906,-0.027947351,-0.03893864,0.03171323,0.009635533,0.06088947,0.0154021,0.0006755217,-0.039758842,0.025434932,0.021642063,-0.029