	 ('78a46e3b-32eb-46d6-b2f1-d278bee56769'::uuid,'With twenty-four hours of quiet behind them, Sector 13 resumes normal operations. Two victors are brought aboveground to film propaganda telling the nation that the district survived, but are unable to perform due to emotional distress. They are both sedated, and arrangements begin to rescue captured victors.
The victors film propaganda to distract the Capitol during an assault.
Sector 13 commandos successfully carry out the infiltration of the Capitol and secure the three captured victors.
The victors arrive in Sector 13. One is found to have undergone hijacking by the Capitol using locator venom, warping his memories and making him a threat towards another victor.
