	 ('609b9590-d21e-4b8e-89f4-11c0db969d90'::uuid,'As they begin to approach her, Coriolanus sends multiple donations of water into the arena, and a flock of drones start flying into the alliance, who are injured as they stand in the drones'' path. Lucy Gray grabs a jar of water and runs before they notice her. She poisons the water while the other tributes go after another tribute and leaves it in the middle of the arena, pouring out the rest of their water. She narrowly escapes, hiding in a duct as the other tributes chase after another tribute. One tribute ends up drinking the water and passing. Another tribute grieves and collects the bodies of the other fallen tributes, placing them together and covering them with a flag in protest and as a memorial, then stares at the camera as he shouts asking if he will be punished. The Head Gamemaker interrupts the broadcast to inform the others of a mentor''s death, stating she will punish the distributes by attacking the arena, even if it results in no survivors.

As the Dean calls Coriolanus to his office, he chides him for cheating in the Games, forcing Coriolanus to choose between public humiliation, or the option of being a Peacekeeper.','{"source": "The Hunger Games_ The Ballad of Songbirds & Snakes.txt", "charset": "UTF-8", "chunk_id": 3, "position": 3, "chunk_index": 3, "total_chunks": 4, "source_document": "/Users/artem/IdeaProjects/practicum/sprint07/ragbot/./data/replaced/The Hunger Games_ The Ballad of Songbirds & Snakes.txt", "parent_document_id": "90c853d9-d25f-40ac-940f-76e07c756734"}','[0.025697121,0.028057493,0.012054448,-0.014714821,-0.002980934,-0.0060069184,-0.009051636,-0.033998076,-0.051494703,0.021216897,-0.044605825,-0.10777767,-0.0037061702,-0.028616143,-0.046124384,-0.012478996,0.053599697,0.03978172,-0.02687842,0.059585582,0.0013750716,0.018621515,-0.0030370902,-0.075578876,0.034059286,0.018638648,0.053636037,-0.017805623,-0.13495275,0.008812298,0.0029538192,0.036195803,-0.015211081,0.027088027,-0.028615791,0.036177915,0.023490442,0.006470727,0.021382371,-0.014323375,0.029208286,-0.026247378,-0.019376546,0.031374082,0.01039909,-0.021748038,0.0319578,0.0021735851,-0.010240228,-0.043305364,0.05145798,-0.049966924,0.01621079,0.03870988,0.038178064,0.009070336,-0.037641793,0.0311476,-0.015677605,0.013862065,-0.028968196,0.0087378565,-0.020636894,0.011295216,0.011964284,-0.018138332,0.013731637,-0.0153782265,0.0042807674,0.0034076371,0.03590227,-0.015389299,-0.001798705,0.0030132777,0.027487472,-0.027083037,-0.06416949,-0.06292429,-0.0033427402,0.0042641223,0.013749178,-0.024362646,-0.024940278,-0.03355718,0.00442811,-0.012534328,0.0024860345,0.00011334186,0.028931934,-0.008077636,-0.017164852,0.016582016,0.0029121076,0.038337998,0.015227996,-0.03524369,-0.003436735,0.013546579,-0.028961757,0.004340165,-0.004913092,0.04468586,-0.02769599,-0.007229395,0.0019586997,-0.017702134,0.0122163,-0.03902022,0.011284667,-0.0439954,-0.04001279,-0.039649654,0.020742916,0.008924807,-0.0027509278,-0.015673658,0.02337199