	 ('acf87e4e-fab3-4906-9761-20d0f519fbc3'::uuid,'The leader and the Game Master discuss this incident, and the leader wants rid of the protagonist now. The Game Master tells him that while she certainly needs to die it will have to be under the right circumstances, and suggests a way to do it.

The injured tribute suggests a plan to electrocute the two remaining Contestants outside the alliance, using his wire and the tree that is struck by lightning, connected to the saltwater pool and the damp beach. He tells two allies to protect him near the tree until midnight, while the protagonist and another ally run the end of the wire down to the beach. The protagonist and her fellow victor are very reluctant to separate now, but she agrees to lay the wire when her allies imply she intends to break the alliance. The protagonist tells her fellow victor she will see him at midnight and departs. When the wire is unexpectedly cut after a distance, her ally suddenly concusses the protagonist, cutting the locator out of her arm and telling her to stay down, as the other alliance is stalking them. She leads them away from the weakened protagonist.

Thinking her allies broke the alliance, the protagonist tries to find her fellow victor back at the tree, but finds only the injured tribute, who was stunned. Unable to find her fellow victor, and hearing the sound of a cannon, she calls out for him frantically. When her ally appears, she prepares to shoot him, but he stops her by repeating their mentor''s last advice. Changing her mind, the protagonist attaches the remaining wire to an arrow. Her ally warns her not to do it, but she shoots at the force field just as the lightning strike occurs, blowing up the tree, and shutting down the forcefield around the arena. This electrocutes the protagonist, and causes a power outage in the control room. Shocked, the leader calls the Game Master angrily, but the Game Master is gone. The protagonist is paralyzed by the explosion and is too weak to move or speak. She opens her eyes and sees burning sections of the arena dome crashing down around her. A hovercraft appears, descends into the wreckage, and picks her up before she passes out.

She awakens in the hovercraft with an unconscious tribute beside her. Entering the cockpit, the protagonist picks up a needle, ready to attack, but unexpectedly, she finds her mentor, her ally, and the Game Master, revealed to be a rebel agent. The Game Master explains that they and the district rebels, along with half of the Contestants, had been planning to free her to help support their revolution; the hovercraft is headed for another district. When the protagonist learns her fellow victor and another ally were captured, she attacks her mentor for not keeping his promise to save him. The Game Master sedates her, and she awakens days later with her friend by her side, who informs that her family is safe, but her home district has been destroyed. The protagonist, in shock, horror and sadness, begins to look mad in fury, planning to get revenge.','{"source": "The Hunger Games_ Catching Fire.txt", "charset": "UTF-8", "chunk_id": 1, "position": 1, "chunk_index": 1, "total_chunks": 2, "source_document": "/Users/artem/IdeaProjects/practicum/sprint07/ragbot/./data/replaced/The Hunger Games_ Catching Fire.txt", "parent_document_id": "8a12a991-2c1b-45aa-9c97-11550270f8a4"}','[0.04760644,0.042624496,0.026788523,-0.003607612,0.006277445,-0.046096686,0.013683994,-0.0070722746,-0.021360394,0.014109079,-0.05845529,-0.078834645,0.043906137,-0.028342802,-0.011089551,0.0045625167,0.051895384,0.06515634,-0.053358477,0.061094977,-0.0072789467,-0.0029273608,0.0022385553,-0.041870646,-0.010540117,0.039631195,0.03141057,-0.05769633,-0.121309854,-0.0083999345,0.008338059,0.016784502,-0.011868878,0.037770495,-0.00076044624,0.021144548,0.009606228,0.009229117,0.020875713,-0.04094436,0.0251699,0.03317656,0.013112349,-0.0145197185,0.00095854746,0.009377227,0.009424854,-0.040818315,-0.011299137,-0.028862942,0.023391798,-0.043153755,0.022640917,-0.015652731,0.025207298,-0.006270418,-0.018074583,0.010166085,-0.026334915,-0.01085689,-0.016535232,-0.024001319,-0.0053358637,0.033598218,0.04345299