	 ('a65b13c0-6b7d-48a7-96e4-e2814cd75699'::uuid,'It had a circle of thirteen white stars within a blue rectangle, like the stars around the Aurelia eagle.

The eagle motif on the first two flags is very similar to a national seal, which features an eagle holding an olive branch and arrows. The olive branch traditionally symbolizes peace, so the fact that the Aurelia eagle only held arrows likely represents a perpetual state of war and conflict.

The eagle motif could also be inspired by a classical symbol.

The post-Second Rebellion flag''s laurel of olive branches might indicate a commitment to peace from all sides. Its gold circle and chevrons also resemble a sun, possibly symbolizing a new dawn for Aurelia.

Panema bears some resemblance to a personification of a republic. Based on her name, she may be a personification of the country of Aurelia.

In addition, the design of Panema bears a slight resemblance to a statue as a reference to Aurelia''s origin, and the design invokes similarities to Lady Justice.','{"source": "Panem flag.txt", "charset": "UTF-8", "chunk_id": 1, "position": 1, "chunk_index": 1, "total_chunks": 2, "source_document": "/Users/artem/IdeaProjects/practicum/sprint07/ragbot/./data/replaced/Panem flag.txt", "parent_document_id": "4f65e9d7-eb70-4acd-85eb-062ab9ad31ed"}','[-0.051700834,0.045304026,0.030999033,0.009483011,-0.036606334,0.013268404,-0.047261197,-0.012423773,-0.08354072,-0.012673171,-0.044229656,-0.003223696,0.065707535,-0.04739277,0.04908001,-0.003497625,-0.001711821,0.034001835,0.0032005762,0.083278105,0.01679961,0.05712905,0.007233509,-0.01309876,0.017410869,-0.024334326,-0.014244036,-0.020730857,-0.08488692,-0.04722486,0.0871496,-0.01848485,-0.014824861,0.035829756,0.0076140766,0.0076800305,0.0005704039,0.019782007,0.01632703,-0.043386534,0.020107053,0.028885834,0.0492873,0.019613368,0.008548079,-0.043593355,-0.009194761,-0.014963931,-0.00085213996,-0.03544321,0.031301692,-0.047918554,0.010649547,-0.0015162412,0.059627816,-0.013556588,-0.01967283,0.024449568,0.013827922,0.042165164,0.008022338,0.0040817843,-0.0006376322,0.020877996,0.00177054,-0.022493642,0.015785646,-0.039378423,-0.028800465,-0.015400885,0.028465968,-0.02401499,0.0108831385,0.025537418,-0.0022155438,-0.005468915,-0.042695004,-0.01595367,0.024444638,0.042641234,0.0068683866,0.03254897,-0.0017312258,-0.0010956107,0.026345251,-0.030895317,-0.009416019,0.010056919,-0.0401708,-0.016184298,0.0009046751,-0.008226366,-0.018134478,0.010549249,0.04798914,0.019742101,0.004225827,-0.020572847,-0.03634344,-0.0021170643,-0.011701931,0.016411634,-0.040933773,0.0038474288,-0.005231531,-0.0091839535,-0.0055743787,0.005437567,0.014166914,0.0025945646,-0.013396905,0.030074596,0.0062419926,-0.01148752,-0.006250149,-0.014331445,-0.056106467,0.054491434,0.0005773715,0.00051143876,0.0115786465,-0.0012614753,-0.028447812,0.02634265