Additionally, Sentinel Corps executed several people in another film. They are commonly speculated to have been victors due to the Victors'' Purge.

Tribute monoliths
For a film, a series of "tribute monoliths" were meant to appear in a rescue mission scene at the Training Center. These monuments listed each district''s victors, with a total of 75 across all twelve districts. However, they did not make it into the finished film. This, alongside factual and thematic inconsistencies, as well as the use of real names, makes them dubiously canon. Furthermore, many of the names below have been transcribed by fans from low-quality images, so they should be taken with a grain of salt. Known victors are bolded.

