	 ('8f995feb-c913-4cf5-8373-aeef6e672d78'::uuid,'Ethan Carter''s father, called "Pa" by Haymitch, was the father of Haymitch and Sam Abernathy.

Robert Abernathy was born to a family that used to be rebels. He worked in the coal mines. He married Willamae Abernathy and had two sons. They were also going to have twin girls, but they died when they were born too early. Haymitch heard his father crying one night shortly after their loss.
After the death of his boss, he looked out for his orphaned daughter. When she was reaped into the Hunger Games, he visited her with his wife and Haymitch to say goodbye and advised her not to let the Capitol use her.
Haymitch''s father died in a coal mine fire, leaving his wife to care for their two young children. He was buried in the miner''s graveyard, in the family plot. After he died, rumors spread that he died in a seditious event at sabotaging the mines, or that he and his crew were targeted by the Capitol for being "a pack of troublemakers."

According to Haymitch, Robert Abernathy was quite intelligent, but kept to himself and didn''t share all of his ideas. He was distrustful of people who shared every idea they had. He was rumored to be quite rebellious, and this may be evidenced in his words before she went to the Capitol.','{"source": "Haymitch Abernathy''s father.txt", "charset": "UTF-8", "chunk_id": 0, "position": 0, "chunk_index": 0, "total_chunks": 1, "source_document": "/Users/artem/IdeaProjects/practicum/sprint07/ragbot/./data/replaced/Haymitch Abernathy''s father.txt", "parent_document_id": "b4fe1bff-484b-4010-884b-181f4334cd56"}','[0.037097696,0.07413993,-0.004006365,-0.038536187,0.0014583836,-0.058049746,-0.003916713,0.051640656,-0.020132454,0.0037874738,-0.04939915,-0.019644802,0.0019041696,-0.023336504,-0.07875924,-0.012954223,0.0984785,-0.009554627,-0.0030283672,0.070012026,0.044101566,0.014087255,0.03531259,-0.06437296,0.004299964,-0.024363263,0.04089951,0.08101997,-0.07749306,0.031039871,0.0037353074,0.0014861246,-0.03191254,-0.008879057,0.002035559,0.055711247,-0.0041063125,-0.00027413847,-0.020673132,-0.0069884895,0.0037755207,0.00834146,-0.012219529,0.017010476,0.025587218,0.0041776225,0.038168877,-0.027253294,-0.008594477,-0.0013853428,-0.012736969,-0.029706854,-0.004482517,-0.0074030785,0.02629869,-0.010801169,0.02242927,0.045609877,-0.02847422,0.015267126,0.018867914,0.03535272,-0.033691015,0.005611336,0.023241546,-0.00097082026,0.012042829,0.0037901439,-0.014421236,-0.0009708422,0.013280319,0.017580768,-0.021513168,0.0285324,0.040275026,-0.036329616,-0.0620808,-0.056452267,-0.007496832,-0.0014702136,0.008146474,0.002696225,-0.02968644,-0.055038296,-0.019668167,-0.00713828,-0.0067307055,-0.0006853203,0.017481534,0.023265041,0.031860914,0.010000906,-0.011162301,0.014928936,0.011299253,-0.0011155384,0.014470741,0.030030265,-0.009167252,0.024779877,-0.008650148,0.01625522,-0.0031660974,0.00053579814,-0.004981735,0.013697408,-0.025509086,-0.015033059,-0.008341681,-0.02024874,0.005094