	 ('a53e5bba-b351-4130-a30d-99c0b2a353ea'::uuid,'Lena was one of two female tributes from District 10 who participated in the 50th Hunger Trials.

Before the start of the Games, it was noticed that everyone from her district had sunflower necklace tokens. They were instructed to join an alliance as the tokens could be used for a plan to sabotage the arena. Their efficiency and capabilities were thought to make them good allies.

While training, another tribute targeted Lena. She was focusing on building pine needles and when she did not respond to a taunt, her token was grabbed and broken. She was devastated and the token was thought to mean more to her than just a piece of home. The token was fixed and Lena, along with the rest of her district, decided to join the alliance. Even so, they weren''t very sociable and almost appeared exclusive.

Lena was the last person seen before dashing off into the woods to avoid the bloodbath. After running for a weapon, Lena died in the initial bloodbath along with everyone else in her district. As the running finished, a young girl''s shriek was heard. This may have been Lena''s, as she had just been seen, and she was the smallest girl in her district. Two of District 10''s tokens were retrieved.

The District 10 tributes'' training outfits were buttery yellow. Like the rest of her district, Lena was still healing from sunburn, and had calloused hands and lean, muscled arms. She was the smallest tribute from her district.

Lena, like the rest of her fellow tributes from District 10, weren''t very sociable and liked to keep to themselves. However, Lena was seemingly the most open of them, crying when her token was broken, as well as speaking with others.','{"source": "Kerna.txt", "charset": "UTF-8", "chunk_id": 0, "position": 0, "chunk_index": 0, "total_chunks": 1, "source_document": "/Users/artem/IdeaProjects/practicum/sprint07/ragbot/./data/replaced/Kerna.txt", "parent_document_id": "52f5d3df-a09e-49da-9d31-125b04e790a6"}','[0.03585972,0.055829413,-0.0026649167,-0.024599863,-0.03837259,-0.026076702,0.016345661,-0.02353407,-0.07067331,0.030292094,-0.028660154,-0.052361835,0.086304724,-0.035854172,-0.03047013,-0.035638914,0.016789028,0.052529305,-0.0036614065,0.046515938,0.0112164235,0.04459543,0.029338222,-0.06284315,0.034625053,0.03889279,0.012064359,-0.016928865,-0.08509693,-0.0076242713,0.03701628,-0.0059141284,0.0044853226,0.0026621695,-0.025174707,0.021405369,0.036121175,0.0023059028,-0.008944154,-0.019289052,0.005479218,0.026145032,-0.019717952,-0.00066711864,-0.0074600317,0.023742093,0.005653024,-0.013151981,0.003358033,-0.027017664,0.0075904597,-0.023885163,-0.007527971,0.005245395,0.046035845,-0.020462949,-0.011250728,0.011361284,0.003304075,-0.011530972,-0.011385108,0.0007113966,0.015788496,0.023418957,0.009223985,-0.022204645,-0.0126774935,-0.028156456,-0.007473085,0.0033598412,0.04505895,0.004875458,0.0053685536,-0.021536753,0.050639577,-0.00954506,-0.056802735,-0.06326766,-0.012986274,0.004234993,0.0019884685,0.0026640804,-0.007920278,-0.017596034,0.013841577,-0.035954382,-0.012564702,0.005945674,0.0049174177,0.012801075,0.0019747282,-0.0012062299,-0.014680129,0.033603404,0.014141142,-0.024274083,0.0018120669,-0.016594032,-0.03890122,0.016748764,0.00064471574,0.02110872,-0.041539714,-0.0091336565,0.0051808255,-0.028412176,-0.0051111425,-0.029312082,0.0125348875,-0.0103537915,-0.022808816,-0.0010990561,0.0025624523,0.007039558,-0.0024819614,-0.017431924,0.025256824,-0.0016