310508,0.027135326,-0.0004461386,0.01930401,0.015170198]'::public.vector),
	 ('118ba04d-4298-4047-9256-bb44550b5257'::uuid,'Inside the apartment, the squad leader transfers the device to the protagonist and dies after giving her orders. The protagonist tells the team that she is on a secret mission to kill the ruler on the rebel leader''s order. A crew member backs up the protagonist''s story. The squad hesitates but reluctantly helps the protagonist operate the device.
They walk to an abandoned apartment. They all sit down. The TV soon turns on to inform the nation that the protagonist, and the rest of the Squad are dead. The protagonist doesn''t realize that the ally had regained consciousness and saw himself attacking her and killing a squad member on the TV. The ally suggests that they kill him, but the protagonist won''t allow it. After they find food to eat, the ruler comes on the TV and informs the nation that the protagonist was just a girl, not a leader. Back in the rebel district, a rebel hijacks the signal and broadcasts the rebel leader instead, who gives a speech of her own.
The grace period of the capital thinking that the Squad is dead gives a head start for the protagonist, now leading the team. The Squad has a limited period of time before the capital realizes that they are still alive. They start looking for a way out. The team then decides to head into the sewers with the help of a crew member, who used to work there. He navigates the Squad underground. While they sleep, the protagonist can hear strange voices calling her name. The team awakens and the ally shouts a warning to the protagonist, telling her to run as mutts are approaching. They run through an area, avoiding the pods strewn about, but a crew member sets one off, causing him to get caught and killed. The team members force themselves to move on, but they are attacked by lizard mutts, and are forced to fight. Peacekeepers come to try and kill the squad, but they are killed by the lizard mutts. The protagonist sets a pod off deliberately in an attempt to kill most of the mutts whilst they retreat to the surface. Two squad members stay behind, sacrificing themselves so that the others can escape. Two others are also killed by the lizard mutts. The squad makes it to the surface, but the protagonist sees a victor get killed by the lizard mutts. The protagonist uses the device as an explosive. She throws it into the sewers, killing the mutts but destroying the device.
The Squad are shaken by the many deaths. The squad keeps climbing further and further towards the surface until they reach an apartment where they take shelter. Once inside they find a woman, but before she can alert any capital forces, the protagonist kills her. Now, in the heart of the capital, they need to hide until the rebels advance further. As they move through the streets of the capital, they find themselves right in the heart of the capital streets and are at a risk of being seen. A crew member leads them to a shop owned by an old friend. She agrees to keep them safe and feed them. The team manages to stay in the cellar, where they stay for a couple of days and watch the rebels advance. The capital and the rebels are now engaged in a full‑scale war. One night, while everyone sleeps, the protagonist hears the ally and her friend having a conversation about her which upsets her. The next morning, the shop owner heads out to try and gather information. She returns in the evening with food for the squad and informs them that the capital citizens have been forced out onto the streets while the war carries on. She then shows them a television broadcast in which the ruler announces that he is opening the mansion to all capital refugees. The protagonist realizes they need to make use of the flood of refugees in the center of the capital. At first, the others are wary of the plan, but they decide to go forward with it. The squad plans out their course of action.','{"source": "Mockingjay.txt", "charset": "UTF-8", "chunk_id": 2, "position": 2, "chunk_index": 2, "total_chunks": 5, "source_document": "/Users/artem/IdeaProjects/practicum/sprint07/ragbot/./data/replaced/Mockingjay.txt", "parent_document_id": "9579a7da-3de6-4355-83ad-391021ff9f15"}','[-0.015411688,0.06077281,0.002518457,0.016855124,0.012637226,-0.03211443,0.011342433,0.011589125,-0.013370903,0.02263102,-0.08158159,-0.08304332,0.0747603,-0.06032562,0.01314642,0.026670614,0.05375139,0.039979737,-0.036480624,